<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">Theihthaina</book>
  <para style="h">Theihthaina</para>
  <para style="toc1">Theihthaina</para>
  <para style="toc2">Theihthaina</para>
  <para style="mt">Theihthaina</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi aw ta, ahmaohna poh o tawhta bie a vaw chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Nama hry liata ahy rai ta Abeipa lâta hmo nama hlâ tita, viahchao hri nata mietaku zaw tawhta sahroh nama hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“A hmohlâpa cha viahchao hri tawhta raopa hlâna a châ khiahta cha, a chapawpa seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ. A hmohlâpa cha Abeipa hmiakô liata a pyhpa a châ thei nawpa ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao thaby liata a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Raopa hlâna luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, chatanachata ano chatlaina châta raopa hlâna cha ano vyuhpa ta a pyhpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa cha Abeipa hmiakô liata thie aw ta, Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy ta a thisaih hlâ aw ei ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata maisâh kâ zydua liata thisaih ama thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chatawhcha raopa hlâna sahroh cha a vo hlaih aw ta, a pachhaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Theihthaipa Arawna sawchapawzy ta maisâh chô liata mei patih aw ei ta, mei chô liata tho ama pacho aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy ta sa cha, a luh nata a thaw chhaota a vyuh vyuh ta paziah aw ei ta, chazy cha maisâh mei tho chô liata ama soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A chhôrihzy nata a pheizy deikua cha, ti ta a pasi tua awpa a châ. Theihthaipa ta sa cha a zydua ta maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Raopa hlâna châta a hlâ awpa cha mietaku zaw hry liata mietaku tlyma, mie tlyma a châ khiahta cha, a chapawpa seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maisâh kâ maw lâchhâh ta Abeipa hmiakô liata thie aw ta, Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy ta maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih ama thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sa cha a hlâtuhpa ta pachhaih aw ta, theihthaipa ta a luh nata a thaw chhaota maisâh mei tho chô liata a soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chhôrihzy nata a pheizy deikua cha, ti ta a pasi tua awpa a châ. Theihthaipa ta a zydua ta hlâ aw ta, maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“ Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna ta a hlâ awpa cha pavaw hry tawhta a châ khiahta cha, vachhuh tlyma, pivaw taw tlyma a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta maisâh lâ cheih aw ta, a rao chamieh pachhô aw ta, a thisaih cha maisâh kâ liata pathlaoh aw ta, maisâh chô liata a rao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hmi chhaota a daoh hlaih aw ta, maisâh kiapâh nochhi lâchhâh ta buchâh thyna su liata a thy aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mathlawzy chamieh pachhô aw ta, a pachhaih deikua pachhaih pathlah awpa châ vei. Hmohlâpa cha theihthaipa ta maisâh mei tho chô liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta Abeipa lâ niepa hlâna a hlâ tita, viahdie dipa a hlâ awpa a châ. Sathaw bao aw ta, a chô liata deiryh soh aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy lâ a vawkhei aw. Theihthaipa ta viahdie dipa cha a sathaw nata a deiryh zydua chhaota, pazah kha la aw ta, cha cha atheithlâhna hmo a châ aw. Niepa zydua hlâ khaipa a châzie a thei thlâh ha nawpa ta maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Niepa hlâna laibâhpazy cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy châta a châ aw. Cha cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hlâpazy hry liata hmo pathaih chaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Viahchhâ taona beih ta viahchhâ taopa niepa hlâna na hlâ tita, viahdie dipa nata sathaw pahlaopa ta taopa thinô pahlao leipa viahchhâ pakâhpa tlyma, sathaw hniapa thinô pahlao leipa viahchhâ apapa tlyma na hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Na hmohlâpa cha lômathu liata pakâhpa a châ khiahta cha, thinô pahlao leipa viahdie dipa cha sathaw pahlaopa ta na tao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Patlaw aw chi ta, sathaw na bao aw. Cha cha niepa hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Na hmohlâpa cha ukâ ta chateipa niepa hlâna a châ khiahta cha, viahdie dipa sathaw pahlaopa ta tao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Cha hmozy ta taopa niepa hlâna cha Abeipa lâ vaw cheih aw chi ta, theihthaipa hnohta pie aw chi ta, ano ta maisâh lâ a vawkhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Niepa hlâna tawhna chata theihthaipa ta atheithlâhna hmo la aw ta, maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Niepa hlâna laibâhpazy cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy châta a châ aw. Cha cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hlâpazy hry liata hmo pathaih chaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Abeipa lâta mei ta hlâpa châta thinô nata kheihtizy na rao awpa a châ leipa vâta, Abeipa hnohta na hlâ awpa niepa hlânazy cha thinô pahlaopa ta tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Niepa hlânazy cha thei hmiatuapa hlâpa hawhta Abeipa lâta hlâ aw chi ta, maisâh liata ropahâhpa hlâna châta deikua hmâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Niepa hlâna zydua alôh mia khai aw chi ta, na Khazohpa biehrai alôh cha, niepa hlâna liata iah leipa ta a y awpa châ vei. Na hmohlâpa zydua liata alôh na hlâ pâ lymâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thei hmiatuapa tawhta niepa hlâna Abeipa lâta na hlâ khiahta cha, sâh suh a daih tuachaipazy hry tawhta tai aw chi ta, cha cha mei liata zawh aw chi ta, tly aw chi ta, a sâh cha na hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sathaw bao aw chi ta, a chô liata deiryh na soh aw. Cha cha niepa hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta sâh tly chiehpa cha, sathaw nata deiryh zydua chhaota atheithlâhna châta a rao aw. Cha cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chyhsa hmohlâpa cha aryhna hlâna châta atheihna châ sala, viahchao hri tawhta a hlâ khiahta cha, a chapawpa tlyma, a chanôpa tlyma hlâ thei ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmohlâpa luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao thaby liata thie aw ta, Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy ta maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih ama thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aryhna hlâna châta atheihna cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hlâ aw ta, a rihhri nata a chhôrih liata thaw zydua nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a patoh kiapâh liata a lôpo miano nata a lôpo a pahlypa thawzy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha, a lôpozy chhaota la aw ta, a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chazy cha Arawna sawchapawzy ta maisâh liata raopa hlâna mei tho chô liata ama rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna, mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chyhsa ta aryhna hlâna atheihna châta Abeipa lâta a hlâpa cha, mietaku zaw tawhta a châ khiahta cha, a chapawpa tlyma, a chanôpa tlyma hlâ thei ta, seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hmohlâpa châta mietakutaw a cheih khiahta cha, Abeipa hmiakô liata hetana heta a hlâ aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmohlâpa luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, ahmaohna poh o tlyhmia liata thie aw ta, Arawna sawchapawzy ta maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih ama thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata aryhna hlâna atheihna châta mei ta hmohlâpa cha Abeipa lâ a hlâ aw. Abeipa lâta a thawzy a hlâ aw. A lahmei thawhpa a ky ru tlôna taihta lapazy, a rihhrizy, a chhôrih liata thawzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a lôpo miano nata a patoh kiapâh liata a lôpo a pahlypa thawzy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha a lôpozy chhaota la aw ta, a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chazy cha theihthaipa ta maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa niepa hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmohlâpa cha mie a châ khiahta cha, Abeipa hmiakô liata hetana heta a hlâ aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, ahmaohna poh o tlyhmia liata thie aw ta, Arawna sawchapawzy ta maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih ama thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatawhcha a hmohlâpa cha mei ta Abeipa lâ a hlâ aw. A rihhrizy, a chhôrih thawzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a lôpo miano nata a patoh kiapâh liata a lôpo a pahlypa thawzy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha a lôpozy chhaota la aw ta, a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chazy cha theihthaipa ta maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta mei ta hmohlâpa niepa hlâna a châ. A thaw zydua Abeipa eih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thaw tlyma, thisaih tlyma, nama nie awpa châ vei tahpa cha, nama pahrâna maih liata nama chhâ zydua châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy hetana heta chho teh: Abeipa ta tao lei awpa ta bie a piepa kheihawhpa tlyma chyhsa ta taopa ta molei pathlei ha sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />moleina a taotuhpa cha sathawthupa theihthaipa a châpa vâta, Izarei phopi chô liata thaileichâna a patlôsa awpa a châ khiahta cha, a moleina chatlai nawpa ta, viahchao tôh dawpa seina hnei leipa cha, moleina hlâna châta Abeipa lâ a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao thaby liata Abeipa hmiakô ta a vaw chhi aw ta, viahchao tôhpa luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata viahchao tôhpa cha a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sathawthupa theihthaipa ta viahchao tôhpa thisaih cha la aw ta, ahmaohna poh o lâ â ngiakhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thisaih liata a kudy ny aw ta, thisaih cha supathaihpa pohraipa hmia liata Abeipa hmiakô ta ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thisaih cha la heih aw ta, ahmaohna poh o chhôh liata ropahâhpa maisâh kizy liata Abeipa hmiakô ta hnia aw ta, viahchao tôhpa thisaih laibâhpa zydua cha, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata raopa hlâna maisâh thaby liata a patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa thaw zydua la aw ta, a rihhrizy, a chhôrih thawzy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a lôpo miano nata a patoh kiapâh liata a lôpo a pahlypa thawzy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha a lôpozy chhaota la aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />aryhna hlâna viahchao tôhpa thawzy lapa hawhta a la aw. Chazy cha theihthaipa ta raopa hlâna maisâh liata a rao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa vo nata a sapa zydua cha, a luh nata a phei, a chhôrih nata a iezy chhaota,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a pôhpa duata riehmo khôtho lâta buchâh thyna su sithaipa lâ siekhei aw ta, tho ta a rao aw. Viahchao tôhpa sa cha buchâh thyna liata rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Izarei phopi pôhpalôhpa ta Abeipa ta tao lei awpa ta bie a piepa kheihawhpa tlyma taopa ta ama molei pathlei khiahta cha, zawpi tawhta nyupa a châpa chhao ta, thailei ama châ pyly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moleina hmo ama taopa cha pahnopa a châ khiahta cha, moleina hlâna châta zawpi ta viahchao tôh dawpa ama hlâ awpa châ ta, cha cha ahmaohna poh o tlyhmia liata amâ vaw chhi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zawpi chhituhpa machâzy ta viahchao tôhpa luh chô liata Abeipa hmiakô ta ama ku pahnieh aw ei ta, viahchao tôhpa cha Abeipa hmiakô liata ama thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sathawthupa theihthaipa ta viahchao tôhpa thisaih cha la aw ta, ahmaohna poh o lâ â ngiakhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thisaih liata a kudy ny aw ta, pohraipa hmia liata Abeipa hmiakô ta ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thisaih la heih aw ta, ahmaohna poh o chhôh liata ropahâhpa maisâh kizy liata Abeipa hmiakô ta hnia aw ta, viahchao tôhpa thisaih laibâhpa zydua cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata raopa hlâna maisâh thaby liata a patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thaw zydua la aw ta, maisâh liata a rao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata viahchao tôhpa cha hlâ aw ta, theihthaipa châta moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa taozie hawhta a tao aw. Cha hawhna chata theihthaipa ta zawpi châta chatlaina tao aw ta, a ngiahthaipa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa cha riehmo khôtho lâ phaoh aw ta, viahchao tôhpa hmiatuapa a raopa hawhna khata a rao aw. Cha cha zawpi châta moleina hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Ryureituhpa ta Abeipa a Khazohpa ta tao lei awpa ta bie a piepa kheihawhpa tlyma taopa ta a molei pathlei khiahta cha, thailei a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moleina hmo a taopa cha â vaw pahno nahta, hmohlâpa châta mie tôhpa seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mie luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, raopa hlâna thie tyhna liata Abeipa hmiakô ta a thie aw. Cha cha moleina hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moleina hlâna thisaih cha a kudy ta la aw ta, raopa hlâna maisâh kizy liata hnia aw ta, thisaih laibâhpazy cha raopa hlâna maisâh thaby liata a patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thaw zydua cha, aryhna hlâna châta atheihna thaw hawhta maisâh liata rao aw ta, theihthaipa ta a moleina châta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Vâtlâh hry liata chyhsa pakha ta Abeipa ta tao lei awpa ta bie a piepa kheihawhpa tlyma taopa ta a molei pathlei ha khiahta cha, thailei a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moleina hmo a taopa cha â vaw pahno nahta, a moleina chatlai nawpa ta hmohlâpa châta mie chanôpa seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Moleina hlâna sa luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, moleina hlâna cha raopa hlâna su liata a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a kudy ta a thisaih la aw ta, raopa hlâna maisâh kizy liata hnia aw ta, thisaih laibâhpazy cha raopa hlâna maisâh thaby liata a patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thaw zydua cha, aryhna hlâna châta atheihna thaw lapa hawhta la khai aw ta, theihthaipa ta Abeipa châta ropahâhpa châta maisâh liata a rao aw. Theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Moleina hlâna châta mietakutaw hlâ awpa a vaw cheih khiahta cha, a chanôpa seina hnei leipa a vaw cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Moleina hlâna sa luh chô liata a ku pahnieh aw ta, raopa hlâna ama thiena su liata moleina hlâna châta a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta raopa hlâna thisaih cha a kudy ta la aw ta, raopa hlâna maisâh kizy liata hnia aw ta, thisaih laibâhpazy cha raopa hlâna maisâh thaby liata a patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A thaw zydua cha, aryhna hlâna châta atheihna mietakutaw thaw lapa hawhta la aw ta, theihthaipa ta maisâh liata Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa chô liata rao aw ta, moleina hmo a taopa ty thô nawpa ta, theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khihtlâh tymâna kyh liata, mo ta hmôpa ta tlyma, nah ta theipa ta tlyma, chyhsa ta bie pahnotuhpa châ sala, a rei khoh leipa khiahta cha, hmo a paraopa châ ta, a hmoparaona maoh a phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta hmo pathaih leipa, râhsa pathaih leipa athipa tlyma, osa pathaih leipa athipa tlyma, alyhpasa pathaih leipa athipa tlyma a hria khiahta cha, pahno leipa ta a hriapa a châpa chhao ta, pathaih leipa châ ha ta, thailei a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta chyhsa pathaih leina a hria khiahta cha, pathaih leina a tlôkheipa hmo kheihawhpa rai châ sala, pahno leipa ta a hriapa a châpa chhaota, a pahno tita thailei a châ pyly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta hmo chhiepa tao awpa tlyma, hmo phapa tao awpa tlyma, a hmao ta naosia kawpa ta bie â taih khiahta cha, kheihawhpa bietai rai châ sala, pahno leipa ta a taopa a châpa chhaota, a pahno tita thailei a châ pyly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Chazy hry liata miakha liata chhao thailei a châpa chyhsa cha, a moleina phuah aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a moleina chatlai nawpa ta mietaku zaw hry tawhta mietakutaw chanôpa tlyma, mie chanôpa tlyma, moleina hlâna châta Abeipa lâ hlâ aw ta, theihthaipa ta a moleina chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mietakutaw a pachâ thei leipa khiahta cha, a moleina chatlai nawpa ta vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivawtaw pô no tlyma Abeipa lâ a hlâ awpa a châ. Pô kha moleina hlâna châta châ aw ta, ahropa cha raopa hlâna châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Theihthaipa lâ cheih aw ta, theihthaipa ta moleina hlâna hlâ tua aw ta, a luh thaby liata a rao a chamieh aw. Chamieh pachhô awpa deikua châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moleina hlâna thisaih cha maisâh kâ liata thia aw ta, thisaih laibâhpazy cha maisâh thaby liata palosa khai awpa a châ. Cha cha moleina hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahropa cha raopa hlâna châta hlâ aw ta, raopa hlâna taozie hawhta hlâ awpa a châ. Theihthaipa ta a moleina chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivawtaw pô no tlyma a pachâ thei leipa khiahta cha, a moleina chatlai nawpa ta, moleina hlâna châta viahdie di ngaitapa kachu su hrawh su kha a hlâ awpa a châ. Moleina hlâna a châpa vâta, sathaw a bao awpa châ leipa ta, a chô liata deiryh a soh awpa châ hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theihthaipa lâ cheih aw ta, theihthaipa ta atheithlâhna hmo châta pazah kha la aw ta, maisâh chô liata Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa chô liata a rao aw. Cha cha moleina hlâna cha a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cha hmozy hry liata kheihawhpa tlyma a parao hapa kyh liata, theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw. A laibâhpazy cha, niepa hlâna taozie hawhta, theihthaipa châta a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta hmo paraopa ta Abeipa hmo pathaihpazy chô liata a molei pathlei khiahta cha, a moleina ty thô nawpa ta, mietaku zaw hry tawhta mietaku tôhpa seina hnei leipa Abeipa lâ a hlâ awpa a châ. Supathaihpa tâkâ reizie ta reipa ta, mietaku tôhpa mâ dopa cha a tâkâ ta cheih pâ aw ta, thaileichâna hlâna châta a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmo pathaihpa chô liata â doleipa ta a taopa cha thô aw ta, su pangawh su kha baichha aw ta, theihthaipa a pie aw. Theihthaipa ta thaileichâna hlâna mietaku tôhpa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“ Abeipa ta tao lei awpa ta bie a piepa kheihawhpa tlyma chyhsa ta tao sala a molei khiahta cha, pahno leipa ta a tao pathleipa a châpa chhao ta, thaileichâ pyly aw ta, a paraona maoh a phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mietaku zaw hry tawhta mietaku tôhpa seina hnei leipa cha, a mâ dopa chhaota, thaileichâna hlâna châta theihthaipa lâ cheih aw ta, pahno leipa ta a tao pathleipa kyh liata theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abeipa hmiakô liata thailei a châ ha tlaipa vâta, cha cha a thaileichâna hlâna a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta Abeipa châta a ngâchhihna pahleipa ta, chyhsa sôh â vaopa kyh liata zy, chyhsa hnohta pie awpa bie â taihpa kyh liata zy, a parupa kyh liata zy, â doleipa ta a vaih chô liata taopa ta tlyma, a vaih tlybai raruahpa ta tlyma, hmo a parao khiahta cha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cha leipa chhao ta, chyhsa hmo pahleipa a huah sala, haipa ta bie a taihpa ta â do leipa ta a reih khiahta tlyma, cha hmozy hry liata kheihawhpa tlyma taopa ta a molei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hetana heta tao awpa a châ: Molei ha tlai sala, thailei a châ khiahta cha, parupa ta a lapa hmozy, tlybaipa ta a lapa hmozy, a ku liata sôh pavaosapazy, chyhsa hmo pahleipa â huapazy cha a thô khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Haipa ta bie â taihpa hmo zydua â kipa ta thô khai aw ta, thailei a châna noh liata, hneituhpa hnohta su pangawh su kha a baichha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A moleina ty thô nawpa ta Abeipa lâ hmo a hlâ awpa châ ta, mietaku zaw hry tawhta mietaku tôhpa seina hnei leipa cha, a mâ dopa sôh chhaota, theihthaipa lâ a cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a hmotaopa vâta a thaileichâna cha a ngiahthaipa a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Arawna nata a sawchapawzy hnohta hetana heta biepie teh: He he raopa hlâna taozie awpa ryhpa a châ: Raopa hlâna cha maisâh chô liata mei liata azozâkhihdei ta y aw ta, a mylâ taihta a y aw. Maisâh liata mei cha a ia ngâ thlâh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta pala rih dipa ta taopa chysia a tobi aw ta, a sapa khu nawpa ta pala rih dipa ta taopa chaopasy a pasy aw ta, maisâh liata raopa hlâna meipaohzy cha la aw ta, maisâh kâ liata a soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatawhcha a chysia cha pahluh aw ta, chysia hropa a tao aw ta, buchâhzy cha riehmo khôtho su sithaipa lâ a siekhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Maisâh liata mei cha a ia ngâ thlâh awpa châ ta, a thi awpa châ vei. Theihthaipa ta a my chareih ta tho ti aw ta, a chô liata raopa hlâna soh aw ta, cha liata aryhna hlâna thawzy a rao tyh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maisâh liata mei a ia ngâ thlâh ha awpa a châ, a thi awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“He he niepa hlâna taozie awpa ryhpa a châ: Arawna sawchapawzy ta maisâh hmia liata Abeipa hmiakô ta ama hlâ tyh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hlâtuhpa ta niepa hlâna liatapa viahdie dipa pazah kha nata sathaw nata niepa hlâna chô liata deiryh zydua la aw ta, cha cha atheithlâhna hmo châta maisâh liata a rao aw. Cha cha Abeipa châta ropahâh ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A laibâhpazy cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta nie aw ei ta, ahmaohna poh o tlyhmia su pathaihpa liata thinô pahlao leipa ta ama nie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Viahchhâ cha thinô pahlaopa ta tao awpa châ vei. Cha cha kei lâta mei ta hmohlâpa tawhta ama tovyuh awpa ta ei piepa châ ta, moleina hlâna nata thaileichâna hlânazy hawhta hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arawna pathla chapaw zydua ta nie aw ei ta, cha cha Abeipa lâta raopa hmohlâpa tawhta nama pathla zydua ta chhâzaw châta ama tovyuh a châ aw. Cha niepa hlânazy a hriapa maih cha ama pathaih aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“He he Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta sathawthupa ama châ noh ta Abeipa lâ ama hlâ awpa hmohlâpa a châ: Niepa hlâna viahdie dipa tawhta kachu su hrawh su kha, my ta â khophie, zâ ta â khophie ama hlâ tyh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Viahdie cha sathaw nata pahlaopa ta, pakâhna lômathu liata pakâh awpa a châ. Pakâh khai tawhta a vaw ngiakhei aw chi ta, viahchhâ pakâhpa cha a tlawh ta pachhaihpa ta Abeipa châta ropahâhpa niepa hlâna ta na hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Arawna sawchapawzy hry tawhta ano a thla awpa sathawthupa theihthaipa ta niepa hlâna cha a hlâ aw. Cha cha Abeipa tovyuh châ zôzaw aw ta, a zydua ta rao khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta niepa hlâna châta a hlâpa zydua cha rao khai awpa a châ. Nie cheita awpa châ vei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Arawna nata a sawchapawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: He he moleina hlâna taozie awpa ryhpa a châ: Raopa hlâna thie tyhna liata, moleina hlâna chhao Abeipa hmiakô ta thie awpa a châ. Cha cha hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Moleina hlâna châta a hlâtuhpa theihthaipa ta nie aw ta, ahmaohna poh o dôhpachhôh tlyhmia su pathaihpa liata nie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Atheihna sa a hriapa maih cha ama pathaih aw. Kheihawhpa chysia lia rai ta thisaih ta â pie khiahta cha, thisaih ta a kiapa chysiazy cha su pathaihpa liata na pasu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Atheihna sa chhona alei beih cha pakei ha awpa châ ta, dawhbeih ta chhopa a châ khiahta deikua cha, a pathaih ngaitapa ta chata ta ti ta pasi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Theihthaipa chhôhkha laita chapaw zydua ta atheihna sa cha ama nie aw. Cha cha hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Su Pathaihpa liata chatlaina tao nawpa ta, ahmaohna poh o liata a thisaih ama vaw cheipa sa, moleina hlâna châta atheihna sa deikua cha, nie awpa châ vei. Mei ta rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“He he thaileichâna hlâna taozie awpa ryhpa châ ta, hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Raopa hlâna thie tyhna liata thaileichâna hlâna chhao thie awpa châ ta, maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih thia awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaw zydua hlâ khai awpa châ ta, a lahmei thawhpazy, a rihhrizy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a lôpo miano nata a patoh kiapâh liata a lôpo a pahlypa thawzy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha, a lôpozy chhaota la aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cha cha theihthaipa ta Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa châta maisâh chô liata a rao aw. Cha cha thaileichâna hlâna a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theihthaipa chhôhkha liata chapaw zydua ta nie aw ei ta, su pathaihpa liata nie awpa a châ. Cha cha hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thaileichâna hlâna cha moleina hlâna nata a lyu ta, taozie miakha a châ. A sazy cha chatlaina a taotuhpa theihthaipa tovyuh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chyhsa châta raopa hlâna a hlâtuhpa theihthaipa ta, raopa hlâna ta a hlâpa sa vo cha a to aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Viahchhâ taona beih liata taopa niepa hlâna to nata ukâ nata lômathu liata chateipa nata pakâhpa niepa hlâna zydua cha, a hlâtuhpa theihthaipa châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Niepa hlâna châta hlâpa zydua cha, sathaw pahlaopa tlyma, ahipa tlyma, Arawna sawchapaw zydua ta â khopa ta amâ rai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“He he chyhsa ta Abeipa lâta aryhna hlâna a hlânazie awpa ryhpa a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Alyna biereina châta a hlâ khiahta cha, thinô pahlao leipa ta sathaw pahlaopa viahchhâ pakâhpazy, sathaw hniapa thinô pahlao leipa viahchhâ apapazy nata viahdie dipa ta taopa sathaw ta nyhpa viahchhâ pakâhpazy cha, atheihna hlâna sa a hlâna liata a hlâ pâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Alyna biereina châta aryhna hlâna atheihnazy liata deikua cha, viahchhâ thinô pahlaopa a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmohlâpa to tawhta viahchhâ tlâ kha sai hmosaipiepa châta Abeipa lâ hlâ aw ta, maisâh liata aryhna hlâna thisaih a thiatuhpa theihthaipa châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Alyna biereina châta aryhna hlâna atheihna sa cha, a hlâ noh ta nie khai ha awpa a châ. A mylâ my taihta khâpa hmah a pahlôh awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Â theihna hlâna cha bietai hlâna tlyma, lôhthai hlâna tlyma a châ khiahta deikua cha, atheihna a hlâ noh ta nie awpa châ ta, nie laipa cha a mylâ ta nie theipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A noh thôhna noh taihta a ypa atheihna sa deikua cha, mei ta rao khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aryhna hlâna châta atheihna sa kheihawhpa rai, a noh thôhna noh ta ama nie khiahta cha, atheihna cha a pyhpa châ aw vei. Hlâtuhpa chhao hmo a hlâpa hawhta pachâpa châ aw vei. Hmo pathaih leipa châ aw ta, a niepa maihta a hmo paraona maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hmo pathaih leipa kheihawhpa rai a hriapa sa cha, nie awpa châ vei. Mei ta rao awpa a châ. Sa hropazy deikua cha, chyhsa pathaihpazy ta ama nie thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathaih leina chôta Abeipa lâta hlâpa aryhna hlâna atheihna sa a niepa cha, a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmo pathaih leipa kheihawhpa rai, chyhsa pathaih leipa tlyma, sa pathaih leipa tlyma, hmo pathaih leipa pasichhihpa tlyma, chyhsa ta hria sala, chatanachôta Abeipa lâta aryhna hlâna atheihna sa a nie khiahta cha, cha chyhsa cha a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Viahchao thaw tlyma, mietaku thaw tlyma, mie thaw tlyma nama nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sa thiruapa thaw nata sahrâhpa ta a taipa thaw cha, a hmâ nawpa hropazy liata hmâ theipa châ ta, a nie deikua nama nie cheita awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahy rai Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa sa thaw a niepa cha, a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cha hleikhô ta, nama pahrâna lia maihta, kheihawhpa thisaih rai, pavaw thisaih tlyma, sa thisaih tlyma, nama nie cheita awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahy rai thisaih a niepa cha, a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Abeipa lâta aryhna hlâna a hlâpa maihta, a hlâ awpa tawhta thokha cha, atheihna châta Abeipa lâta a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa cha ano ku tlai ta cheih aw ta, a thaw chhao a palôh duata cheih aw ta, chatanachata a palôh cha chaluahpa hlâna ta Abeipa hmiakô liata a chaluah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a thaw cha mei ta maisâh liata rao aw ta, a palôh deikua cha, Arawna nata a sawchapawzy châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aryhna hlâna atheihna sa phei chachâh lâ cha, chalopa hlâna châta theihthaipa nama pie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Arawna sawchapawzy hry liata aryhna hlâna thisaih nata thaw a hlâtuhpa ta, a tovyuh châta a phei chachâh lâ cha â la aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Izarei sawzy aryhna hlâna atheihna sazy tawhta a palôh chaluahpazy nata a phei chalopazy la na ta, theihthaipa Arawna nata a sawchapawzy hnohta ei pie. Cha cha Izarei sawzy tawhta chhâzaw ta ama tovyuh a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cha cha Abeipa châta theihthaipa chakaona rai hria awpa ta, Arawna nata a sawchapawzy raopa ama châ noh tawhta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpazy tawhta ama tovyuh châta panano eihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cha cha Izarei sawzy ta theihthaipazy ama pie tyh awpa ta Abeipa ta biepie ta, sathawthupa ama châ noh tawhta ama chhâ zydua liata chhâzaw ta ama tovyuh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chazy cha raopa hlâna, niepa hlâna, moleina hlâna, thaileichâna hlâna, chahnaona hlâna nata aryhna hlâna atheihna taoziezy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama hmohlâpazy Abeipa lâta vaw cheih awpa ta, Abeipa ta Sinai râhchawhpa liata Izarei sawzy bie a pie noh ta, Sinai Tlâh liata Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Arawna kha a sawchapawzy chhaota a chhi la, chysiazy, sathaw pathaihpa, moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa, mietaku tôhpa pô no nata viahchhâ thinô pahlao leipa hrâbyh hmo kha cheih la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />zawpi zydua cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao chheipâh liata kei pahmaoh teh,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mawsi cha Abeipa biepiepa hawhta tao ta, zawpi zydua cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao chheipâh liata ypakhy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawsi ta zawpi hnohta, “He he tao awpa ta Abeipa biepiepa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapawzy cha a vaw chhi ta, ti ta ama ngai pasi ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Arawna cha chôtho paky ta, chaisaihna pasaih ta, poh pabu ta, ephaw paky thlu ta, zôpha kawpa ta sapa ephaw chaisaihna ta a chai saih ta, cha chata ephaw cha a pôhpa nata saih pa-i ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta chachôhna vyhphao paky ta, chachôhna vyhphao liana cha Uri nata Thumi khô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, a luh liata lakhu pakhu ta, lakhu hmia lâ liata ngôh lakho pathaihpa pakho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatawhcha Mawsi ta sathaw pathaihpa la ta, achhyna byureih nata a chhôh liata hmo a ypa zydua thupa ta pathaisa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maisâh chô liata sathaw ei sari thia ta, maisâh nata a hmobaoh zydua, rahô nata a patyunazy sathawthupa ta pathaisa ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arawna luh liata sathaw pathaihpa bao ta, cha hawhna chata Arawna cha pathaisapa ta panano ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, Mawsi ta Arawna sawchapawzy a vaw chhi ta, chôtho pakysapa ta, chaisaihna pasaih ta, khuthozy a pakhu ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatawhcha moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa a vaw chhi ta, Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa luh chô liata ama ku pahnieh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mawsi ta viahchao tôhpa cha thie ta, a thisaih la ta, a kudy ta maisâh kizy hniapa ta, maisâh cha pathaisa ta, thisaih laibâhpazy cha maisâh thaby liata patlai ta. Chatanachata maisâh châta chatlaina tao ta, maisâh cha a pathaisa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mawsi ta a rihhri thaw zydua, a pathi a pahlypa thaw nata a lôpo miano nata a thawzy la ta, maisâh liata rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, viahchao tôhpa vo, a sapa nata a ie deikua cha, riehmo khôtho liata rao khaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta raopa hlâna mietaku tôhpa cha hlâ ta. Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta mietaku tôhpa luh chô liata ama ku pahnieh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawsi ta mietaku tôhpa cha thie ta, maisâh kâ zydua liata a thisaih thia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mietaku tôhpa cha pachhaih ta, a luh nata a sapa pachhaihpazy nata a thawzy rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawsi ta mietaku tôhpa chhôrih nata pheizy cha ti ta pasi ta, mietaku tôhpa cha a zydua ta maisâh liata rao ta. Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, cha cha ropahâhpa châta raopa hlâna, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chatawhcha mietaku tôhpa hropa, chahnaona mietaku tôhpa hlâ heih ta. Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta mietaku tôhpa luh chô liata ama ku pahnieh ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mawsi ta mietaku tôhpa cha thie ta, a thisaih la ta, Arawna nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata a chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi zy liata hnia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Mawsi ta Arawna sawchapawzy chhao a chhi ta, ama nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata ama chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi liazy ta thisaih hnia ta. Thisaih cha maisâh kâ zydua thia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chatawhcha mietaku tôhpa thaw, a lahmei thawhpa, a rihhri thaw, a pathi a pahlypa thaw, a lôpo miano nata a thawzy nata a phei chachâh lâ la ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abeipa hmiakô liata a ypa viahchhâ thinô pahlao leipa hrâbyh tawhta viahchhâ pakâhpa miakha, sathaw pahlaopa viahchhâ puahpa miakha nata viahchhâ apapa miakha la ta, a thaw nata a phei chachâh lâ chô liata soh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cha zydua cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ku liata soh ta, âmo ta chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chaluah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta Mawsi ta ama ku tawhta la ta, maisâh liata raopa hlâna chô liata rao ta. Cha cha ropahâhpa châta chahnaona hlâna, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, Mawsi ta a palôh la ta, chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chaluah ta. Cha cha chahnaona mietaku tôhpa tawhta Mawsi tovyuh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mawsi ta sathaw pathaihpa nata maisâh liata thisaihzy la ta, Arawna nata a chysiazy thia ta, a sawchapawzy nata a ama chysiazy chhao thia hra ta. Cha hawhna chata Arawna nata a chysiazy cha pathaisa ta, a sawchapawzy nata ama chysiazy chhao a hnohta pathaisapa a châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapawzy hnohta, “Sa cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata chhoh u la, ‘Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta ama nie awpa a châ,’ tahpa ta bie ei piepa hawhna khata, chahnaona hlâna hrâbyh liata viahchhâ chhaota, cha su liata nie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sa nata viahchhâ nie laibâhpazy cha mei ta nama rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nâmo chahnao awpa ta noh sari byuh ta, chavâta chahnaona nohzy nama châta â ki hlâlei cha, noh sari chhôh ahmaohna poh o chhikao tawhta nama pua awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tanoh ta taopa hawhna heta, nama châta chatlaina tao awpa ta Abeipa ta bie a pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata noh sari chhôh chhô nah zâ ta y aw ei chi ta, nama thi lei nawpa ta, Abeipa biepiepa cha nama zyh awpa a châ. Cha cha ei hnohta biepiepa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chatanachata Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta bie a piepa zydua cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy ta tao khai ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A noh chariena noh ta, Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapawzy nata Izarei machâzy aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Arawna hnohta, “Moleina hlâna châta viahchao tôh dawpa nata raopa hlâna châta mietaku tôhpa, seina hnei leipa raihrie a chhi la, Abeipa hmiakô liata hlâ mah y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta, ‘Moleina hlâna châta mie tôhpa nata raopa hlâna châta viahchaotaw nata mietakutaw kô khapa raihrie, seina a hnei leipazy cheih u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abeipa hmiakô liata aryhna hlâna atheihna châta viahchao tôhpa nata mietaku tôhpa cheih hra u la, sathaw pahlaopa niepa hlâna chhao cheih u la, Abeipa lâ hlâ teh u. Tanoh he nama hnohta Abeipa â vaw luah aw,’ tah mah y,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawsi biepiepa hawhta, hmo hlâ awpazy cha ahmaohna poh o tlyhmia liata vaw cheih ei ta, zawpi zydua ta a kei hniapa ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata a duah ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawsi ta, “ Abeipa rônahna nama hnohta â vaw luah thei nawpa ta, hetana heta tao awpa ta Abeipa ta bie a cha pie ei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatawhcha Mawsi ta Arawna hnohta, “Maisâh a vaw hnia la, na moleina hlâna nata na raopa hlânazy vaw hlâ la, nâma châta nata zawpi châta chatlaina tao teh. Abeipa biepiepa hawhta, zawpi vyuhpa ta hmohlâpa hlâ la, ama châta chatlaina tao teh,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Arawna ta maisâh cha a kei hnia ta, ano châta moleina hlâna viahchaotaw cha thie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Arawna sawchapawzy ta thisaih kei pie ei ta, thisaih liana cha a kudy ny ta, maisâh kizy liata hnia ta, thisaih laibâhpa cha maisâh thaby liata patlai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta bie a piepa hawhta, moleina hlâna thaw nata a lôpozy nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy cha, maisâh chô liata rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sapa nata a vo deikua cha, riehmo khôtho liata mei ta rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arawna ta raopa hlâna cha thie ta, a sawchapawzy ta a thisaih vaw pie ei ta, maisâh kâ zydua liata thia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Raopa hlâna sa cha a tlo tlo ta a luh chhaota vaw pie ei ta, maisâh liata rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A chhôrihzy nata a pheizy pasi ta, maisâh liata raopa hlâna chô liata rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta zawpizy hmohlâpa cha hlâ ta. Zawpi châta moleina hlâna mie cha a chhi ta, thie ta, a hmiatuapa hawhna khata, moleina hlâna châta hlâ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Raopa hlâna chhao cheih ta, a taozie awpa ryhpa raopa hawhta hlâ ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta niepa hlâna cheih ta, cha tawhtapa cha pazah kha la ta, maisâh liata rao ta, cha cha mydi ta raopa hlâna hleikhô ta hlâ baichhipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatawhcha zawpi châta aryhna hlâna atheihna viahchao tôhpa nata mietaku tôhpa thie ta. Arawna sawchapawzy ta a thisaih vaw pie ei ta, maisâh kâ zydua liata thia ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa thaw nata mietaku tôhpa thaw, a lahmei thawhpa, a rihhri, a lôpo nata a pathi a pahlypa thawzy vaw pie ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thawzy cha a palôh chô liata soh ei ta, maisâh liata rao ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawsi biepiepa hawhta, a palôh nata a phei chachâh lâ cha, Arawna ta chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chaluah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Arawna ta zawpi lâ a ku pazawh ta, âmo cha byhnâ awpa ta, moleina hlâna, raopa hlâna nata aryhna hlânazy a hlâ khai tawhta za chô ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mawsi nata Arawna cha ahmaohna poh o liata a kei ngia ei ta, vaw pua heih ei ta, zawpi châta byhnâ aw ei ta. Abeipa rônahna chyhsa zydua chô liata a vaw luah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abeipa tawhta mei vaw pua ta, maisâh liata raopa hlâna nata thawzy cha vaw kâ ta. Cha cha zawpi zydua ta ama hmô nahta, thata awh ei ta, â khu lâta pao ei ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Arawna sawchapawpa Nâdâ nata Abihu ta ropahâhpa ama raona byh la chyu ei ta, a chhôh liata mei soh ei ta, ropahâhpa mia ei ta, Abeipa ta âmo bie a pie leipa mei hropa hmâpa ta Abeipa hmiakô liata hlâ ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa tawhta mei vaw pua ta, âmo cha kâsao ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata thi ha ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chatanachata Mawsi ta Arawna hnohta, “He he Abeipa ta, Nâ hniatuhpazy hry liata Pathaihpa ta a luah aw na ta, Chyhsa zydua hmiakô liata Palyupalihpa ta ei y aw, A tahpa kha a châ hih,” tah ta. Arawna cha a chalih thlâh ha ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mawsi ta Arawna paw unawhpa Uzie sawchapaw Misela nata Elzaphâ aw ta, ama hnohta, “A vaw hnia u la, nama unawhzy he su pathaihpa tawhna heta a sy u la, riehmo khôtho lâ puakhei teh u,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawsi reipa hawhta a vaw hnia ei ta, ama viahkao ta âmo cha a sy ei ta, riehmo khôtho lâ ama puakhei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapaw Eliaza nata Ithamâ zy hnohta, “Nama sâ pathliah leipa u la, nama chysiazy hrie hra khuh vy. Chataleipatala thi aw ei chi ta, zawpi zydua chô liata Abeipa hiehâhna a vaw tlô pathlei aw na. Nama chiheih Izarei chhôhkha zydua deikua ta, Abeipa ta mei ta a pakâsao hapazy cha chakhei mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abeipa sathaw pathaihpa nama chô liata y ta, chavâta ahmaohna poh o chhikao tawhta nama pua awpa châ vei, chataleipatala nama thi pathlei aw na,” tah ta. Mawsi bie hawhna chata tao ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abeipa ta Arawna hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nâ tlyma, na hnohta a ypa na sawchapawzy tlyma, ahmaohna poh o chhôh lâ namâ ngia tita, kresawhti tlyma, sahma thatlôpa tlyma nama doh awpa châ vei. Chataleipatala nama thi pathlei aw. Cha cha nama chhâ zydua châta chhâzaw ryhpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmo ziehchhôhpa nata hmo vâtlâhpa panano aw ei chi ta, hmo pathaih leipa nata pathaihpa nama panano awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta Izarei sawzy hnohta bieraopa a reipa zydua cha, âmo nama pachu lymâ awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatawhcha Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapaw a hrohpa Eliaza nata Ithamâ hnohta, “ Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa niepa hlâna laibâhpazy la u la, hmo pathaih ngaitapa a châpa vâta, thinô pahlao leipa ta maisâh kiapâh liata nie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa tawhta nâ nata na sawchapawzy tovyuh a châpa vâta, su pathaihpa liata nama nie awpa a châ. Cha hawhta tao awpa ta biepiepa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A palôh chaluahpa nata a phei chachâh lâ chalopa cha, nâ nata na hnohta a ypa na sawchapawzy nata sawchanôzy ta su pathaihpa liata nama nie aw. Cha cha Izarei sawzy châta aryhna hlâna atheihnazy tawhta, nâ nata na sawzy tovyuh châta raopazy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A phei chalo awpa nata a palôh chaluah awpazy cha, chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chaluahpa a châ thei nawpa ta, mei ta hlâ awpa a thawzy chhaota ama vaw cheih aw. Abeipa biepiepa hawhta, cha cha nâ nata na sawchapawzy châta chhâzaw ta nama tovyuh a châ aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mawsi ta moleina hlâna châta hlâpa mie thâtih cha pakhâta ta patluah ta, rao hapa a châpa pahno ta. Chavâta Arawna sawchapaw a hrohpa Eliaza nata Ithamâ chô liata a hiehâh kaw ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Khazia moleina hlâna sa cha, supathaihpa su liata nama nie vei? Cha cha hmo pathaih ngaitapa châ ta, zawpi thaileichâna phaoh ta, Khazohpa hmiakô liata âmo châta chatlaina tao nawpa ta nama hnohta piepa châ vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ei biepiepa hawhta, supathaihpa chhôh liata nama nie tlai awpa châ ta, châhrasala supathaihpa chhôh lâ a thisaih a ngiakhei veih ei chi,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arawna ta Mawsi hnohta, “Pachâ teh, tanoh he ama moleina hlâna nata ama raopa hlâna Abeipa hmiakô liata hlâ ei ta, cha nota, kha hawhpa hmo kha ei chô liata vaw tlô ta, chavâta tanoh he moleina hlâna nie aw sah la, Abeipa mohmô ta hmo phapa a châ aw ma?” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cha bie cha a thei nahta Mawsi cha a palôh tlâh ha ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi nata Arawna chho ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy hetana heta chho teh u: Hezy he alei chô liata hrona a hneipa sa zydua hry tawhta nama nie thei awpazy a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sazy hry liata a chakie pachiah ta, a chakie miano ta â pachhaihpa ta, thie a chaeihpa maih nama nie thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thie chaeihpa ta a chakie a pachhaih hra sala, hezy deikua cha nama nie awpa châ vei: Râraoseihpa cha a thie chaeih hra sala, a chakie â pachhaih leipa vâta, nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlâh pazupi chhao a thie chaeih ta, châhrasala a chakie â pachhaih leipa vâta nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pazupi chhao a thie chaeih ta, châhrasala a chakie â pachhaih leipa vâta, nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vao he a chakie cha pachiah ta, a chakie miano ta a pachhaih ta, châhrasala a thie a chaeih leipa vâta, nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sa nama nie awpa châ leipa ta, a thiruapa chhao nama hria awpa châ vei. Nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ti liata a pahrâpa zydua hry liata hezy he nama nie thei aw. Tilaipi liata tlyma, chavah liata tlyma, ti liata a pahrâpa, mathlaw nata phuhlu a hneipa maih nama nie thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tilaipi nata chavah liata a pahrâpa zydua nata ti liata hmohrohneipa a ypa zydua hry liata mathlaw nata phuhlu a hnei leipa maih cha, nama châta pasichhihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chazy cha nama châta pasichhihpa ta nama pachâ awpa châ ta, ama sa nama nie awpa châ leipa ta, a thiruapazy chhao nama pasi ngaita awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ti liata a ypa mathlaw nata phuhlu a hnei leipa maih nama châta pasichhihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pavaw hry liata, hezy he nama pasi ngaita awpa châ ta, nama nie awpa châ vei, pasichhihpa ama châ: Pahmôhpi, vâkhieh kâhhmi hneipa, tilaipi pahmôhpi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hmôchhih, riarâtaoh chi to,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />raawh chi to,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />vawpô, valâtla, nârâ seihhaohpa, pahmôh chyhpa chi to,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />vaku chyhpa, tyhphy nga a niepa, tutahlupa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />vaku râhpa, ti pavaw hmaotô laipa, vâkhieh sa thiruapa a niepa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />varâh keihseihpa, riasi chi to, nôpinô nata pazu tâbalâpa zy cha nama nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Lôvâpa mathlaw hnei ta, phei palih ta a siepa zydua nama châta pasichhihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mathlaw hnei ta, phei palih ta a siepa chi hry liata, alei liata a chapie nawpa ta ama phei chô lâta byhpi a pazaopa zydua deikua nama nie thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khawsu chi to, khawsu hmi leipa chi to, chiacharipa chi to nata khawthlôhraihpa chi to chhao nama nie thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mathlaw ta a zaw ta, phei palih a hneipa lôvâ hropa zydua deikua, nama châta pasichhihpa a châ khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hezy vâna heta pathaih leipa nama châ aw: Ahy rai sa pathaih leipa thiruapa a hriapa cha, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahy rai cha hawhpa sa thiruapa a phaohpa cha, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sa a chakie pachiah ta, châhrasala a chakie miano ta a pachhaih leipa nata thie a chaeih leipa chi maih cha, nama châta pathaih leipa châ ta, ahy rai cha hawhpa sa thiruapa a hriapa cha pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Phei palih ta a siepa sa hry liata phei pazah ta a siepa maih cha nama châta pathaih leipa châ ta, cha hawhpa sa thiruapa a hriapa cha zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha hawhpa sa thiruapa a phaohpa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Chazy cha nama châta hmo pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Alei liata alyhpasa chizy hry liata, Zabih, siahloh, sawsâ chi to,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />taokieh, tisadâh, ohâpa, tlypahniapa nata kauapa zy cha nama châta a pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chazy cha alyhpasa zydua hry liata nama châta pathaih leipazy châ ta, ahy rai cha hawhpa sa thiruapa a hriapa cha zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Alyhpasa pathaih leipa thiruapa ta a tla thlupa hmobaoh chhao pathaih leipa a châ aw. Tho hmobaoh tlyma, chysia tlyma, savo tlyma, sykhao tlyma, kheihawhpa châta hmâpa hmobaoh rai châ sala, ti liata pachie awpa châ ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Cha khai tawhta a pathaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Alyhpasa thiruapa ta alei beih chhôh liata a tla khiahta cha, beih chhôh liata a ypa zydua pathaih leipa châ aw ta, beih cha nama pakei ha awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nie thei awpa niedo kheihawhpa rai, cha beih liata ti ta a hria hapa cha pathaih leipa a châ aw. Dopa chi zydua chhao, cha hawhpa beih chhôh liata a ypa cha pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmo khâpa rai, cha hawhpa sa thiruapa ta a tla thlupa cha pathaih leipa a châ lymâ aw. Viahchhâ taona beih tlyma, beih kheihawhpa rai châ sala, a tlawh ta pakeichheih khai awpa a châ. Pathaih leipa châ ha ta, nama châta pathaih leipa a châ lymâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tihnawh tlyma, tikhaoh tlyma deikua cha, pathaih leipa ta y leipa aw ta, a chhôh liata alyhpasa thiruapa a hriapa deikua pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chikao chei awpa kheihawhpa rai, alyhpasa thiruapa ta a tla thlu khiahta cha, pathaih leipa châ aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Alyhpasa thiruapa ta a tla thlupa chikao cha, ti liata pachie chiehpa a châ khiahta deikua cha, nama châta pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“A sa nama nie theipa chi kheihawhpa tlyma thi sala, cha sa thiruapa a hriapa cha, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cha thiruapa sa a niepa cha, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Sa thiruapa a phaohpa chhao, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Alei chô liata alyhpasa chi zydua pasichhihpa châ ei ta, nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A py ta a lyhpa chi tlyma, phei palih ta a siepa chi tlyma, phei hluhpi a hneipa chi tlyma, alei chô liata a lyhpa chi zydua cha pasichhihpa châ ei ta, nama nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Alyhpasa vâta nâmosasyh pasichhihpa ta namâ tao awpa châ leipa ta, âmo vâta nâmosasyh a papuapaleipa ta, pathaih leipa ta nama y awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ. Kei pathaih tlôh na ta, chavâta a pathai u la, pathaihpa ta y teh u. Alei chô liata alyhpasa kheihawhpa ta hmah namâ papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kei he nama Khazohpa châ awpa ta Izi râh tawhta châ kaw chhi papuatuhpa Abeipa ei châ. Kei pathaih tlôh na ta, chavâta nâmo chhao nama pathaih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Chazy cha sa nata pavaw nata ti liata a pahrâpa hmohrohneipa to nata alei liata alyhpasa chi tozy kyh liata ryhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathaihpa nata pathaih leipa panano awpa châ ta, hmohrohneipa nie theipa nata hmohrohneipa nie lei awpa chi chhao panano awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Chanô ta saw phaoh sala, sawchapaw a sa khiahta cha, noh sari chhôh nawhkhutlô aw ta, chanô hnopasu daihti liata pathaih leipa hawhta pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A noh chariena noh ta, hawtipa cha a chopaw vo tai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noh sythôh nata noh thôh chhôh a sawsana thi lohpa tawhta pathaina tao awpa châ ta, pathaina noh â ki hlâlei cha, hmo pathaihpa a hria awpa châ leipa ta, supathaihpa liata â ngia awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawchanô a sa khiahta cha, hnopasu daihti liata pathaih leipa hawhta, hâta ei no chhôh nawhkhutlô aw ta, noh sycharu nata noh charu chhôh a sawsana thi lohpa tawhta pathaina tao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Sawchapaw vâta tlyma, sawchanô vâta tlyma, â pathaina noh â ki nahta, raopa hlâna châta mietakutaw kô khapa nata moleina hlâna châta pivaw taw tlyma vachhuh tlyma, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata theihthaipa lâta a cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta Abeipa hmiakô liata hlâ aw ta, chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a thi lona tawhta a pathaih aw. Cha cha saw a sapa chanô, chapaw a sapa tlyma, chanô a sapa tlyma châta ryhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mietakutaw a hnei thei leipa khiahta cha, vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivaw taw pô no tlyma cheih aw ta, pô kha cha raopa hlâna châta châ aw ta, ahropa cha moleina hlâna châta a châ aw. Theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, chatanachata a pathaih aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi nata Arawna chho ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta a pôhpa vo thlohpa tlyma, hmahchaku tlyma, pakheihpa tlyma hnei sala, phawhpa hri a châ awpa hawhta a pôhpa vo liata â lâ khiahta cha, theihthaipa Arawna lâ tlyma, a sawchapawzy hry liata theihthaipa pakha lâ tlyma a chhi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a pôhpa vo liata hri cha moh aw ta, hri yna liata hmi cha pawh sala, hri yna cha a pôhpa vo hlâta a thu viapa ta â lâ khiahta cha, phawhpa hri châ ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha moh aw ta, chyhsa pathaih leipa a châ tahpa a phuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pôhpa vo pakheihpa cha vaw râh ta, a vo hlâta a thu viapa ta a lâ leipa sala, a hmi a pawh leipa khiahta cha, hri ohtuhpa cha theihthaipa ta noh sari chhôh ânano ta a khawhlôh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, theihthaipa ta moh heih aw ta, a hri cha a ualua ta hmô sala, a kawh via leipa khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta noh sari ânano ta a khawhlôh via chy aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha moh heih aw ta, pakheihpa cha lei laihpa ta, a vo liata a kawh laih leipa khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaihpa ta a phuah aw. A hri ohpa cha riatha rakhapa châ ta, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, pathaihpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathaisa awpa ta theihthaipa â pamosa khai tawhta, riatha cha a vo liata a kawh lymâ khiahta deikua cha, theihthaipa â pamosa heih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, riatha cha a vo liata a kawh lymâpa a hmô khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa a châ tahpa a phuah aw. Cha cha phawhpa hri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta phawhpa hri a oh khiahta cha, theihthaipa lâ a chhi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, a vo thloh sala, cha chata a hmi papawhpa ta, a thlohpa liata a sapa â kaw palie khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />phawhpa hri pakâhpâpa a vo liata a ypa châ ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa a châ tahpa a phuah aw. Pathaih leipa a châpa â lâ hapa vâta, ânano ta khawhlôh byuh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A vo râhpa cha kawh laih sala, theihthaipa hmô theipa rakha liata, hri ohtuhpa cha a vo zydua, a luh tawhta a phei taihta vo râhpa ta a bu khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, vo râhpa ta a pôhpa zydua a bu khiahta cha, hri ohtuhpa cha a pathaih tahpa a phuah aw. A pôhpa duata a râh khai hapa vâta pathaihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sapa â kaw palie khiahta deikua cha, pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta sapa a paliepa cha moh aw ta, cha chyhsa cha pathaih leipa a châ tahpa a phuah aw. Sapa a paliepa cha pathaih leipa, phawhpa hri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sapa a paliepa cha vaw pha ha sala, a vaw râh heih khiahta cha, theihthaipa lâ a pangai heih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta ano cha moh aw ta, hri cha a râh khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta hri ohtuhpa cha a pathaih tahpa a phuah aw. A pathaih hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Pôhpa vo liata kheihluh thla ta, tlâh ha ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kheihluh yna su liata a râhpa ta a thlohpa tlyma, a saih tôlôhpa ta a pakheihpa tlyma a y khiahta cha, theihthaipa pamosa awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, vo hlâta a thu viapa ta a lâpa ta, a hmi a pawh khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah aw. Phawhpa hri châ ta, kheihluh liata a vaw puapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moh ta, hmi pawhpa y leipa sala, vo hlâta a thu via leipa ta, hmah cha a chawh laih khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta noh sari ânano ta a khawhlôh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmah cha vo liata a kawh laih khiahta deikua cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah aw. Cha cha hri chhiepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A saih tôlôhpa ta a pakheihpa cha, a yna ualua liata y sala, a kawh via leipa khiahta cha, kheihluh hmahdawpa dei châ ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaihpa ta a phuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Pôhpa vo liata mei kâna y sala, mei kâna sapa a paliepa cha a saih tôlôhpa ta tlyma, a râhpa ta tlyma a pakheih khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, a pakheihpa liata hmi cha pawh sala, vo hlâta a thu viapa ta â lâ khiahta cha, phawhpa châ ta, mei kâpa liata â vaw luahpa a châ. Theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah aw. Cha cha phawhpa hri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Châhrasala theihthaipa ta moh ta, pakheihpa liata hmi pawhpa y leipa sala, mei kâna hmah cha vo hlâta a thu via leipa ta, a chawh ha khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta noh sari chhôh ânano ta a khawhlôh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta noh sarina noh ta moh aw ta, hmah cha vo liata a kawh lymâ khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah aw. Cha cha phawhpa hri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pakheihpa cha a yna ualua liata ypa ta, vo liata kawh laih leipa sala, a chawh laih khiahta cha, mei kâna thlohpa châ ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha a pathaih tahpa a phuah aw. Cha cha mei kâpa hmahdawpa dei a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Chapaw tlyma, chanô tlyma ta, a luh liata tlyma, a kâh liata tlyma hri a hnei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />theihthaipa ta hri cha moh aw ta, vo hlâta a thu viapa ta a lâ sala, hmi di maihpa a y khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah aw. Pathapa hri châ ta, luh nata kâh liata phawhpa hri a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta pathapa hri cha moh aw ta, vo hlâta a thu via leipa ta a lâ sala, hmi vyhpa a y leipa khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta pathapa hri a hneituhpa cha noh sari chhôh ânano ta a khawhlôh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, theihthaipa ta hri cha moh aw ta, pathapa hri cha kawh leipa sala, hmi maihpa y leipa ta, pathapa hri cha vo hlâta â thu via leipa khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a kâhhmi a ngyu aw ta, pathapa hri yna hmi deikua cha a ngyu awpa châ vei. Theihthaipa ta pathapa hri a hneipa cha noh sari ânano ta a khawhlôh via aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, theihthaipa ta pathapa hri cha moh heih aw ta, pathapa hri cha vo liata kawh leipa sala, vo hlâta a thu viapa ta â lâ leipa khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaihpa ta a phuah aw. A chysiazy pasu aw ta, chatanachata a pathaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathaisapa a châ khai tawhta, pathapa hri a vo liata a kawh laih khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />theihthaipa ta a moh heih awpa a châ. Pathapa hri cha vo liata a kawh laih khiahta cha, hmi maihpa a y ma tahpa theihthaipa ta a mo awpa byuh vei. Pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Pathapa hri cha a yna ualua liata a ypa ta hmô sala, hmi vyhpa a kaw thao khiahta deikua cha, pathapa hri cha a tlâh hapa châ ta, a pathaih hapa a châ. Theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaihpa ta a phuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Chapaw tlyma, chanô tlyma, a pôhpa vo liata pakheihpa y sala, pakheihpa cha a râhpa a châ khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, a pôhpa vo liata pakheihpa cha phiephuh râhpâh dei a châ khiahta cha, pakheih chakhyhpa vo liata a vaw puapa châ ta, ano cha a pathaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Chyhsa a sâ a py khai ha khiahta cha, luh pôlôpa châ ta, châhrasala pathaihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A khi sâ a py khai ha khiahta cha, khi tlyhpa châ ta, châhrasala pathaihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A luh pôlôpa liata tlyma, a khi tlyhpa liata tlyma, pakheihpa saih tôlôhpa a kaw pua khiahta cha, a luh pôlôpa liata tlyma, a khi tlyhpa liata tlyma phawhpa hri a vaw puapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, a luh pôlôpa liata tlyma, a khi tlyhpa liata tlyma hri a kaw puapa cha, pôhpa vo liata phawhpa a vaw lâpa hawhta saih tôlôhpa ta a kaw pua khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />chyhsa phawhpa châ ta, pathaih leipa a châ. A luh liata a hri a ypa châ ta, theihthaipa ta ano cha pathaih leipa ta a phuah thlyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Phawhpa hri a ohpa cha chysia a hriepa a ky aw ta, a sâ pathliah aw ta, a hmao chô lâ khu aw ta, ‘Pathaih leipa, pathaih leipa,’ tahpa ta a awh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hri a oh chhôh zydua pathaih leipa a châ. A pathaih leipa vâta, ânano ta y aw ta, a y nawpa su cha riehmo khôtho lâ a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Sahmi chysia liata tlyma, pala rih dipa chysia liata tlyma, chysia liata phawhpa hri a kia khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />sahmi chysia nata pala rih dipa chysiazy sana thaitôh nata thaipheih liata zy, savo nata savo ta taopa hmobaoh liata zy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />phawhpa hri y sala, cha hri cha chysia liata tlyma, savo liata tlyma, thaitôh liata tlyma, thaipheih liata tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh liata tlyma, a rôh hrohpâpa ta tlyma, saihpâpa ta tlyma ta â vaw lâ khiahta cha, phawhpa hri châ ta, theihthaipa pamosa awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta hri cha moh aw ta, hri kiapa hmo cha noh sari chhôh ânano ta a khawhlôh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, hri cha moh aw ta, chysia liata tlyma, thaitôh liata tlyma, thaipheih liata tlyma, savo liata tlyma, savo cha kheihawhpa châ rai ta hmâpa a châpa chhao ta, a kawh lymâ khiahta cha, hri cha phawhpa hri a paka theipa châ ta, pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chysia tlyma, sahmi pala tlyma, pala rih dipa tlyma, thaitôh tlyma, thaipheih tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh kheihawhpa tlyma, phawhpa hri ta a kiapa maih cha, mei ta rao awpa a châ. Phawhpa hri cha a kawh theipa chi a châpa vâta, mei ta rao thlyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />“Theihthaipa ta moh aw ta, hri cha chysia liata tlyma, thaitôh liata tlyma, thaipheih liata tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh liata tlyma, a kawh laih leipa khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />theihthaipa ta hri kiana hmo cha pasi awpa ta bie pie aw ta, noh sari ânano ta a khawhlôh via heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hri ta a kiapa hmo cha, pasi khaipa a châ tawhta, theihthaipa ta moh heih aw ta, phawhpa hri ta a chhôh lâ tlyma, a chô lâ tlyma rai kia ha sala, hri cha a kawh leipa chhao ta, a rôh â nano leipa khiahta cha, pathaih leipa châ ta, mei ta na rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Theihthaipa ta moh ta, hri yna cha pasi khaipa a châ tawhta, a rôh a lei khiahta cha, hri yna su cha chysia tawhta tlyma, savo tawhta tlyma, thaitôh tawhta tlyma, thaipheih tawhta tlyma a hrie pathlah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hri cha chysia liata tlyma, thaitôh liata tlyma, thaipheih liata tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh liata tlyma â vaw luah heih khiahta cha, a paka hapa châ ta, hri ta a kiapa hmo cha mei ta na rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Chysia tlyma, thaitôh tlyma, thaipheih tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh tlyma, na pasi khai tawhta hri ta a paisai khiahta cha, a einona ta pasi heih awpa châ ta, chatanachata a vaw pathaih aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />“Cha cha sahmi chysia liata tlyma, pala rih dipa chysia liata tlyma, thaitôh liata tlyma, thaipheih liata tlyma, savo ta taopa hmobaoh liata tlyma, phawhpa hri a y tita, a pathaih nata pathaih lei phuah nawpa ryhpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“He he phawhpa a pathaih noh ta taozie awpa ryhpa a châ: Phawhpa cha theihthaipa lâ a chhi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Theihthaipa cha riehmo khôtho lâ pua aw ta, phawhpa cha moh aw ta, phawhpa chô liata phawhpa hri cha a tlâh ha khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />theihthaipa ta pathaisa awpa phawhpa châta pavaw pathaihpa a hrohpa ta pô no, sidy tho, pala saihlawpa nata hisaw zy cheipa awpa ta bie a pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta pavaw pô kha cha alei beih chhôh liata chavah ti pasohpa chô liata thie awpa ta bie a pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pavaw hrohpa cha la aw ta, sidy tho nata pala saihlawpa nata hisaw zy chhaota cheih aw ta, chavah ti chô liata thiepa pavaw thisaih liata a ny aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Phawhpa hri tawhta pathaisa awpa cha, pavaw thisaih ta ei sari thia aw ta, ano cha pathaihpa ta phuah aw ta, pavaw hrohpa cha lyurâhpa lâ a pathlie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Pathaisa awpa chyhsa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, a hmi zydua a ngyu aw ta, ti ta a ngai a si aw ta, a pathaih ha aw. Cha khai tawhta riehmo lâ a ngia thei aw ta, châhrasala a poh o khôtho liata noh sari a y chy awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta a luh sâ zydua, a kâhhmi nata a hmaohmi zydua nata a mokhitlâh hmi zydua â ngyu aw. A hmi zydua â ngyu khai awpa a châ. A chysiazy pasupa ta, ti ta a ngai a si aw ta, chatanachata a pathaih ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“A noh chariena noh ta mietakutaw chapawpa seina hnei leipa pô no, mietakutaw chanôpa kô khapa seina hnei leipa pô kha nata niepa hlâna châta viahdie dipa sathaw pahlaopa kachu su hrawh su thôh nata sathaw chhiehraôh ôh kha a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pathaisatuhpa theihthaipa ta a pathaisa awpa chyhsa nata cha hmozy cha ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata Abeipa hmiakô ta a soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta mietakutaw chapawpa pô kha cha sathaw byh chhaota la aw ta, thaileichâna hlâna châta hlâ aw ta, chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata a chaluah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Moleina hlâna nata raopa hlâna ama thie tyhna su, supathaihpa liata mietakutaw chapawpa cha a thie aw. Moleina hlâna cha theihthaipa tovyuh a châpa hawhta, thaileichâna hlâna chhao theihthaipa tovyuh a châ hra. Cha cha pathaih ngaitapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thaileichâna hlâna thisaih cha la aw ta, a pathaisa awpa nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata a chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi zy liata a hnia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta sathaw ôh liata sathaw chyhta a chavei lâ kupazah liata bô aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cha liata a chachâh lâ kudy ny aw ta, a kudy ta Abeipa hmiakô liata ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a ku liata sathaw laibâhpazy cha a pathaisa awpa nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata a chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi zy liata a hnia aw. Chazy cha thaileichâna hlâna thisaih a thiapa chô liata a hnia thlu aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatawhcha theihthaipa ta a ku liata sathaw laibâhpazy cha a pathaisa awpa luh liata hnia aw ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Theihthaipa ta moleina hlâna hlâ aw ta, a pathaih leina tawhta pathaisa awpa châta chatlaina taopa aw ta, cha khai tawhta raopa hlâna a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta raopa hlâna nata niepa hlâna cha maisâh liata a hlâ aw. Cha hawhna chata theihthaipa ta chatlaina taopa aw ta, a vaw pathaih ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Dyhchhiepa châ sala, a hneina ta a tloh leipa khiahta cha, mietaku chapawpa pô kha cheih aw ta, ano châta chatlaina tao nawpa ta, thaileichâna hlâna châta chaluahpa a châ aw. Niepa hlâna châta viahdie dipa sathaw pahlaopa kachu su hrawh su kha nata sathaw chhiehraôh ôh kha cheih aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivawtaw pô no tlyma, a hnei viapa thithaw cheih hra aw ta, pô kha cha moleina hlâna châta châ aw ta, ahropa cha raopa hlâna châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chazy cha, phawhpa ta ano pathaisa nawpa ta, a noh chariena noh ta, theihthaipa lâ a cheih awpazy châ ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata Abeipa hmiakô ta a cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thaileichâna hlâna mietakutaw nata sathaw chhiehra ôh kha la aw ta, chaluahpa hlâna châta Abeipa hmiakô liata a chaluah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta theihthaipa ta thaileichâna hlâna mietakutaw cha a thie aw. Thaileichâna hlâna thisaih cha la aw ta, a pathaisa awpa nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata a chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi zy liata a hnia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chatawhcha theihthaipa ta sathaw chyhta a chavei lâta kupazah liata bô aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a ku chavei lâta sathaw cha, a ku chachâh lâta kudy ta Abeipa hmiakô liata ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a ku liata sathaw cha a pathaisa awpa nakao chachâh lâ pawhmao nata a chachâh lâ kupi nata pheipi zy liata thaileichâna hlâna thisaih a hniana su chô liata a hnia thlu aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a ku liata sathaw laibâhpazy cha a pathaisa awpa luh liata thu aw ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vachhuhzy tlyma, pivawtawzy tlyma, a hneipa thithaw theihthaipa ta hlâ aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />moleina hlâna châta pô kha hlâ aw ta, raopa hlâna châta pô kha, niepa hlâna chhaota hlâ aw ta, pathaisa awpa châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cha cha phawhpa hri pathaisana hmohlâpa ryhpa hawhta a tao thei leipazy châta pathaisana ryhpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi nata Arawna chho ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Nama ryuto châta Kâna râh ei cha piepa ei namâ ngia tita, nama ryuto râh liata kheihawhpa o lia rai ta phawhpa hri ei soh khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />o hneituhpa ta theihthaipa lâ vawh aw ta, ‘Ei o liata hri a lyupa a ypa hawhta ei pahno,’ tahpa ta a chho aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />O chhôh liata hmo a ypa zydua pathaih leipa a châ pathlei lei nawpa ta, theihthaipa ta hri moh awpa ta â ngia hlâta, o cha parua awpa ta bie a pie aw. Cha khai tawhta o moh awpa ta theihthaipa cha â ngia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hri cha moh aw ta, hri chata a rôh hrohpâpa ta tlyma, saihpâpa ta tlyma, pâhchhô nie sala, pâhchhô hlâta a thu viapa ta â lâ khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />theihthaipa cha o tawhta chhikao lâ pua aw ta, o cha noh sari a khaw aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A noh sarina noh ta, theihthaipa cha a vy heih aw ta, moh aw ta, hri cha pâhchhô liata a kawh laih khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />hri yna pâhchhô alôzy la ta, khihpi khôtho lâ su sithai leipa liata thy awpa ta bie a pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta o chhôh zydua pahaosa khai aw ta, ama haona paohpazy cha khihpi khôtho lâ su sithai leipa liata ama patlai khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Alô hropazy la aw ei ta, alô ama thy hapa suzy liata soh aw ei ta, beihlei hropa la aw ei ta, o cha ama pamih pathi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />“Alôzy thy khai tawh chhao ta nata o cha hao khaipa ta pamih pathi khaipa a châ tawh chhao ta, o liata hri a vaw pua heih khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />theihthaipa ta a ngia aw ta, a moh heih aw. Hri cha o liata a kawh via laih khiahta cha, a kawh theipa phawhpa hri o liata a ypa châ ta, o cha pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />O cha phiepa châ aw ta, alôzy, thozy nata pachawh pâna beihlei zydua cha khihpi khôtho liata su sithai leipa lâ paly awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cha o khaw chhôh ta a ngiapa maih zâlâ taih pathaih leipa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cha o liata a riepa maih cha ama chysiazy pasu aw ei ta, cha o liata pati a niepazy chhao ama chysiazy ama pasu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />“Theihthaipa ta moh awpa ta a vy ta, hri cha o pamih pathipa a châ tawhta a kawh via laih leipa khiahta cha, theihthaipa ta o cha pathaihpa ta a phuah aw. Hri cha a pai hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />O pathaisa nawpa ta pavaw pô no, sidy tho, pala saihlawpa nata hisaw cheih aw ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />pavaw pô kha cha alei beih chhôh liata chavah ti pathaihpa chô liata a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Sidy tho, hisaw, pala saihlawpa nata pavaw hrohpa cha la aw ta, pavaw thiepa thisaih nata pahlaopa chavah ti liata ny aw ta, o cha ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Chatanachata o cha pavaw thisaih, chavah ti, pavaw hrohpa, sidy tho, hisaw nata pala saihlawpa zy ta a pathaisa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Pavaw hrohpa cha khihpi tawhta lyurâhpa lâ pathlie aw ta, cha hawhna chata o châta chatlaina taopa aw ta, o cha a vaw pathaih ha aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cha cha phawhpa hri chi to nata riatha kyh liata ryhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Chysia liata phawhpa a ypa nata o liata a ypa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />a byuhpa, riatha nata pabôpa zy kyh liata,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />pathaih leipa nata pathaihpa pahno nawpa ryhpa a châ. Cha cha phawhpa hri kyh liata ryhpa a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi nata Arawna chho ta, ama hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho u la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh u: Chapaw ahy rai a chapaw châna tawhta hniah a pua khiahta cha, hniah cha pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />He he chapaw châna tawhta hniah a puapa vâta pathaih leina ryhpa a châ: Hniah cha a pua pazao ngâ thlâh ha tlyma, â chalih ha tlyma, pathaih leipa a châ khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hniah hneipa aziana rakhô cha pathaih leipa châ aw ta, â tyuna chhao pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A rakhô a hriapa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hniah hneipa atyuna liata a tyuhpa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hniah hneipa pôhpa a hriapa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hniah hneipa ta chyhsa pathaihpa pachih ta a pachhao khiahta cha, chyhsa pathaihpa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hniah hneipa chyhsa kiana kypadia cha pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hniah hneipa chyhsa ry lâta a ypa hmo a hriapa cha zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Cha hmozy a phaohpa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hniah hneipa ta ti liata a ku a si ha tua leipa ta a hriapa chyhsa cha, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hniah hneipa ta a hriapa alei beih cha pakei awpa châ ta, tho hmobaoh zydua deikua, ti liata pasi khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hniah hneipa cha a hniah tawhta a pathaih ha khiahta cha, ano pathaisana châta noh sari hmâh aw ta, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, chavah ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, chatanachata a pathaih ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A noh chariena noh ta, vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivawtaw pô no tlyma cheipa ta Abeipa hmiakô lâ vawh aw ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata theihthaipa a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moleina hlâna châta pô kha, raopa hlâna châta pô kha hlâ aw ta, a hniah lopa châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chapaw ahy rai a baoti a pua khiahta cha, a pôhpa duata ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Baoti ta a kiapa chysia nata vo zydua ti liata pasupa ta pasi khai awpa châ ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chapaw ta chanô a ziakhei sala, a baoti a papua khiahta cha, ama pano ta ti liata ama ngai a si aw ei ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chanô ta a chanô châna tawhta a puapa hnei sala, a puapa cha thi a châ khiahta cha, chanô hnopasupa vâta noh sari chhôh pathaih leipa châ aw ta, ahy rai ano a hriapa cha zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pathaih lei chhôh ta â ziana maih cha pathaih leipa châ aw ta, â tyuna maih chhao pathai leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A rakhô a hriapa cha a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Â tyuna a hriapa chhao a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rakhô liata hmo a ypa nata â tyuna liata hmo a ypa a hriapa cha zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chapaw ta ano cha a ziakhei sala, a chanô thi lopa pathaih leina cha â hlao khiahta cha, cha chapaw cha noh sari chhôh pathaih leipa châ aw ta, â ziana rakhô maih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Chanô a hnopasu daihti tyhpa châ leipa ta, noh hluhpi hnopasupa ta ypa ta tlyma, a chanô hnopasu daihti tyhpa hlâta noh hluh via ta hno a pasu khiahta tlyma cha, a chanô hnopasu daihti tyhpa chhôh ta a pathaih leina yzie hawhna khata a hno pasu chhôh zydua a y hra aw, pathaih leipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hnopasu chhôh zydua ta â ziana rakhô maih cha, a chanô hnopasu pathaih leina daihti tyhpa liata a rakhô hawhta châ aw ta, â tyuna maih chhao, a chanô hnopasu pathaih leina daihti tyhpa liata a pathaih leipa hawhta pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahy rai cha hmozy a hriapa cha pathaih leipa châ aw ta, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Chanô cha a hnopasupa tawhta a pathaih ha khiahta cha, pathaisana châta noh sari hmâh aw ta, cha khai tawhta a pathaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A noh chariena noh ta, vachhuh pô no tlyma, pivawtaw pô no tlyma cheih aw ta, theihthaipa hnohta ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta moleina hlâna châta pô kha, raopa hlâna châta pô kha hlâ aw ta, hnopasupa vâta a pathaih leina châta Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Cha hawhna chata Izarei sawzy cha ama pathaih leinazy tawhta na panano awpa ei a châ. Chataleipatala ama pathaih leina vâta, ama hry liata ei achhyna byureih papuapalei aw ei ta, ama thi pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Cha cha a chapaw châna tawhta hniah a lohpa nata a baoti a puapa vâta pathaih leipa a châ hapa chapaw châta ryhpa châ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />chanô hnopasupa vâta a pathaih leipa châta ryhpa a châ hra. Chapaw chhao, chanô chhao, a chapaw châna nata a chanô châna tawhta a puapa a hneipa zydua châta ryhpa châ ta, chanô hnopasu chhôh ta a ziakheipa chapaw châta ryhpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Arawna sawchapaw pano ta mei pathaih leipa hmâpa ta Abeipa lâta ropahâhpa ama hlâpa vâta ama thi tawhta Abeipa ta Mawsi cha bie a chho ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta, “Na unawhpa Arawna chho teh. A khona daihti maihta Byh chô liata patyupa zawngiahna dyuchhai hmiakô liata pohraipa chhôh Su Pathaihpa lâ â ngia awpa châ vei. Zawngiahna dyuchhai chô liata meihdo hry liata a vaw luah tlôh aw na ta, chavâta a thi pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Arawna cha Su Pathaihpa lâ â ngia tita, moleina hlâna châta viahchao tôh dawpa nata raopa hlâna châta mietaku tôhpa chhaota â ngia awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pala rih dipa viahkao pathaihpa a ky aw ta, a sapa khu nawpa ta pala rih dipa chaopasy â pasy aw. Pala rih dipa chaisaihna a saih aw ta, pala rih dipa lakhu â khu aw. Chazy cha chysia pathaihpa a châ. Ti liata a ngai a si tua aw ta, cha khai tawhta chysiazy cha â tobi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izarei zawpi tawhta moleina hlâna châta mie tôhpa pô no nata raopa hlâna châta mietaku tôhpa pô kha a la aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Arawna ta ano moleina hlâna châta viahchao tôhpa hlâ aw ta, ano nata a chhôhkha châta chatlaina a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mie pô no a chhi aw ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata Abeipa hmiakô ta a soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Arawna ta mie pô no chhichâ nawpa cha nuby a daopa ta â tlyh aw. Nuby miakhapa liata ‘ Abeipa châta’ tahpa roh aw ta, nuby hropa liata ‘Azaze châta’ tahpa a roh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa châta a tlupa mie cha Arawna ta la aw ta, moleina hlâna châta a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azaze châta a tlupa mie cha, chatlaina tao nawpa ta râhchawhpa lâ pathlie awpa ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata ahrohpa ta a soh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Arawna ta ano châta moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa cheih aw ta, ano nata a chhôhkhazy châta chatlaina tao aw ta, ano châta moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa cha a thie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatawhcha mei-ia ta a biepa meilana beikoh cha, maisâh tawhta Abeipa hmiakô liata la aw ta, ropahâhpa pahâh ngaitapa, a dipa ta phypa kupazah miano chhaota, pohraipa chhôh lâ â ngiakhei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ropahâhpa cha Abeipa hmiakô ta mei liata mia aw ta, ropahâhpa khuh ta Biehrai Byh chô liata zawgiahna dyuchhai cha pahly aw ta, chatanachata thina a tyh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Viahchao tôhpa thisaih la aw ta, a kudy ta zawngiahna dyuchhai nochhi lâchhâh thia aw ta, zawngiahna dyuchhai hmia lâ chhao, a kudy ta thisaih cha ei sari a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Cha khai tawhta zawpi châta moleina hlâna mie thie aw ta, pohraipa chhôh lâ a thisaih â ngiakhei aw. Viahchao tôhpa thisaih a taopa hawhna khata, mie thisaih chhao cha tao aw ta, zawngiahna dyuchhai chô liata nata zawngiahna dyuchhai hmiakô liata a thia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chatanachata Izarei sawzy pathaih leinazy, ama paraonazy nata ama moleina zydua vâta Su Pathaihpa châta chatlaina a tao aw. Cha hawhna chata, ama pathaih leinazy hry liata ama hnohta a ypa ahmaohna poh o châta chhao a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatlaina tao awpa ta Su Pathaihpa lâ â ngiana daihti tawhta, ano nata a chhôhkha nata Izarei zawpi châta chatlaina tao ta, a vaw pua heih hlâlei cha, ahy hmahta ahmaohna poh o chhôh liata ama y awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta, Abeipa hmiakô liata maisâh lâ pangai aw ta, maisâh châta chatlaina a taopa aw. Viahchao tôhpa thisaih nata mie thisaihzy la aw ta, maisâh kizy liata â dôna taihta a hnia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maisâh cha a kudy ta thisaih ei sari thia aw ta, a pathaisa aw. Cha hawhna chata maisâh cha Izarei sawzy pathaih leinazy tawhta a pathaisa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Su Pathaihpa, ahmaohna poh o nata maisâh zy châta chatlaina a tao khai tawhta, mie hrohpa cha a hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arawna ta mie hrohpa luh chô liata a ku kârano pahnieh aw ta, Izarei sawzy paraona, tao pasina nata moleina zydua mie chô liata palâhâh aw ta, chazy cha mie luh chô liata a soh khai aw. Mie cha rao eihpa chyhsa ku liata pie aw ta, râhchawhpa lâ a kei pathliesa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mie cha râhchawhpa liata pathlie aw ta, chatanachata ama paraona zydua cha mie ta chyhsa y leina râh lâ a siekhei ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chatawhcha Arawna cha ahmaohna poh o liata a ngia aw ta, Su Pathaihpa lâ â ngia nota pala rih dipa chysia â taopazy pahluh aw ta, cha liata a siesai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Su pathaihpa liata ti ta a ngai a si aw ta, a chysia â tao heih aw. Cha khai tawhta vaw pua aw ta, ano châta raopa hlâna nata zawpi châta raopa hlâna hlâ aw ta, ano nata zawpi châta chatlaina a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Moleina hlâna thaw cha maisâh liata a rao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Azaze châta mie a pathlietuhpa chhao a chysia pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, cha khai tawhta riehmo lâ â di aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chatlaina tao nawpa ta Su Pathaihpa liata ama thisaih a ngiakheipa moleina hlâna viahchao tôhpa nata moleina hlâna mie cha, riehmo khôtho lâ puakhei awpa châ ta, ama vozy, ama sapazy nata ama iezy mei ta rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mei ta a raotuhpa cha a chysia pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, cha khai tawhta riehmo lâ â di aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“He he nama châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw: Thla sarina noh hrawhna noh liata a paky aw ei chi ta, a râh chyhsa chhao, chihropa nama hry ta a pahrâpa chhao, khâpa rai hmahta nama hria awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cha noh liata, nâmo pathaisa awpa ta nama chatlaina taopa châ aw ta, chatanachata Abeipa hmiakô liata nama moleina zydua tawhta nama pathaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cha cha nama châta Pahânoh zachhihpa châ ta, namâ paky awpa noh a châ. Cha cha chhâzaw châta bieraopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Theihthaipa, a paw su a thla awpa ta sathawthupa nata pananopa ta pala rih dipa chysia pathaihpa a tobi aw ta, chatlaina a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Supathaihpa, ahmaohna poh o nata maisâh zy châta chatlaina tao aw ta, theihthaipazy nata zawpi châta chhao chatlaina a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Izarei sawzy moleina zydua vâta ama châta kô kha ta ei kha chatlaina tao tyh awpa cha, nama châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw,” tah ta. Chatanachata Abeipa ta Mawsi bie a piepa hawhta Arawna ta tao ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Arawna nata a sawchapawzy nata Izarei saw zydua chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh. He he Abeipa biepiepa a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izarei pathla ahy rai viahchao tôhpa tlyma, mietakutaw tlyma, mie tlyma, riehmo liata tlyma, riehmo khôtho lâ tlyma thie sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abeipa achhyna byureih hmiakô liata Abeipa lâta hmohlâpa ta hlâ awpa ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata a vaw cheih leipa cha, thisaih a palopa ta pachâpa châ aw ta, a chô liata thisaih maoh a y aw. Cha chyhsa cha a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izarei sawzy ta lyurâhpa liata atheihna ama hlâ tyhpazy kha, Abeipa lâta hlâ awpa ta, ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata theihthaipa lâta cheipa ta, aryhna hlâna atheihna châta Abeipa lâta ama hlâ thei nawpa ta, he ryhpa he taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata Abeipa maisâh chô liata thisaih thia aw ta, a thaw cha Abeipa châta ropahâhpa châta a rao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amâ phei tyhna mie tôhpa khazohzy lâta atheihnazy ama hlâ awpa châ khao vei. Cha cha ama chhâ zydua châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ama hnohta hetana heta reih via teh: Izarei pathla ahy tlyma, chihropa ama hry liata a pahrâpa ahy tlyma, raopa hlâna tlyma, atheihna tlyma hlâ sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abeipa lâta hlâ awpa ta ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata a vaw cheih leipa khiahta cha, cha chyhsa cha a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Izarei pathla ahy tlyma, chihropa ama hry liata a pahrâpa ahy tlyma, thisaih kheihawhpa rai a niepa maih cha, cha thisaih a nietuhpa cha hiehâhpa ta moh aw na ta, a phopi tawhta ei chhawh pathlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sapa hrona cha thisaih liata y ta, cha cha nama hronazy chatlai nawpa ta, maisâh liata ei cha pie ei. Thisaih cha hrona châ ta, hrona chatlaina a tao theituhpa cha thisaih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chavâta Izarei sawzy hnohta, ‘Nama hry liata ahy hmahta thisaih nama nie awpa châ leipa ta, chihropa nama hry liata a pahrâpa ahy hmahta thisaih ama nie awpa châ vei,’ ei tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Izarei saw tlyma, chihropa ama hry liata a pahrâpa tlyma, râh a khie sala, sa tlyma, pavaw tlyma, nie theipa chi a vaw phaoh khiahta cha, a thisaih palo aw ta, dohlei ta a khu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmohrohneipa to hrona cha a thisaih a châ. A thisaih cha a hrona a châ. Chavâta Izarei sawzy hnohta, ‘Kheihawhpa sa thisaih hmah nama nie awpa châ vei. Hmohrohneipa to hrona cha a thisaih châ tlôh ta, chavâta thisaih a niepa cha chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw,’ tahpa ta ei chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ano kho ta a thipa tlyma, sa taipa tlyma a niepa cha, a râh chyhsa chhao, chihropa chhao, a chysiazy pasu aw ta, ti liata a ngai a si aw ta, zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Cha khai tawhta a pathaih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A chysiazy pasu leipa sala, a ngai â si vei khiahta cha, a paraona maoh a phaoh aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama vaw pahrâna Izi râh liata ama taozie hawhna khata nama tao awpa châ leipa ta, ei cha tlôkhei awpa su Kâna râh liata ama taozie hawhta nama tao awpa châ hra vei. Ama bieraopazy nama zyh awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ei ryhpazy a pyh aw ei chi ta, ei bieraopazy zyhpa ta, ei lâpi namâ chhih awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ei bieraopazy nata ei ryhpazy nama zyh awpa châ ta, chazy cha chyhsa ta a tao khiahta cha, chazy vâna chata a hroh aw: Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ahy hmahta nama chhôhkha sipazy a hniapa ta, ama hno ty ta, ama thluahruana palâpa ta namâ ziakhei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Na nô hno typa ta na paw thluahruana na palâ awpa châ vei. Na nô hno typa cha na paw dua thliapa a châ. Ano cha na nô châ ta, a hno na ty awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na paw lapinô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Cha cha na paw dua thliapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Na sietanô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Na paw sawchanô rai châ sala, na nô sawchanô rai châ sala, o kha liata na pilâhpa chhao, o hro lâta a pihpa chhao, a hno rai na ty awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na sawchapaw lâta na samohnô hno tlyma, na sawchanô lâta na samohnô hno tlyma na ty awpa châ vei. Âmo thluahruana palâpa cha nâma thluahruana palâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Na paw lapinô sawchanô, o kha liata na laiseih khohpa hno na ty awpa châ vei. Ano cha na sietanô a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na paw sietanô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Ano cha na paw chhôhkha sipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na nô narônô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Ano cha na nô chhôhkha sipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na paw unawhpa thluahruana na palâ awpa a châ leipa vâta, a lapinô nâ hnia awpa rai châ vei. Ano cha na nô a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Na myuhnô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Na sawchapawpa lapinô châ ta, a thluahruana na palâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na unawhpa lapinô hno na ty awpa châ vei. Cha cha na unawhpa thluahruana palâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Chanô nata a sawchanô cha, ama pano ta ama hno na ty awpa châ vei. A sawchapawpa sawchanô tlyma, a sawchanônô sawchanô tlyma hneipa ta ama thluahruana na palâ awpa châ vei. Chhôhkha sipazy châ ei ta, cha hawhta taopa cha moleina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Na lapinô hro chhôh ta, a narônô cha na lapinô châta hneipa ta, a hno na ty awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Chanô a hnopasu pathaih lei daihti liata a hniapa ta a hno na ty awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Na vaih lapinô a ziakheipa ta, ano vâta nâ papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Na saw ahy hmahta atheihna ta Môleka lâ na hlâ awpa châ vei. Cha hawhta hmo taopa ta na Khazohpa moh na papuapalei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chanô a ziakheipa hawhta chapaw nâ ziakhei awpa châ vei. Pasichhihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sahroh ykheipa ta nâ papuapalei awpa châ vei. Chanô chhao sahroh hmia liata a duahpa ta â paykheisa awpa châ vei. Cha cha molei khuachhuapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Cha hawhpa hmozy taopa ta, nâmosasyh a papuapalei khah u. Cha hmozy ama taopa vâta, nama hmiakô liata ei papua laihpa phopizy kha amâ papuapalei hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha vâna chata râh chhao papuapaleipa ta y ta, ama hmo paraona vâta hrie ei na ta, râh ta a chhôh liata a pahrâpazy a pali ha ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nâmo deikua cha, a râh chyhsa chhao, chihropa nama hry liata a pahrâpazy chhao, ei bieraopazy nata ei ryhpazy nama zyh awpa châ ta, cha hmo pasichhihpa kheihawhpa hmahta nama tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cha hmo pasichhihpa zydua cha, he râh liata nâmo hlâta a vaw pahrâ tuapa phopi ta tao ei ta, chavâta râh cha papuapaleipa ta a y hapa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nâmo chhao, râh nama papuapalei khiahta cha, nâmo hlâta a vaw y tuapa phopi hawhna khata râh ta a cha pali hra aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cha hmo pasichhihpa kheihawhpa rai a taopazy cha ama phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chavâta hmo pasichhihpa phoryhpa, nâmo y hlâta he râh liata a vaw y tuapa phopizy ta ama taopazy kha nama tao hra lei nawpa ta, ei biepiepa he zyh u la, cha hmozy liata a papuapalei khuh vy. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei zawpi zydua chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Kei Abeipa nama Khazohpa he pathaih tlôh na ta, chavâta nâmo chhao nama pathaih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nama nô nata nama paw nama za chyu awpa châ ta, ei Pahânohzy nama chay awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nothlahpa khazoh lâ a heih leipa u la, thua ta leihpa nothlahpa khazohzy a tao khuh vy. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“ Abeipa lâta aryhna hlâna atheihna namâ hlâ tita, a pyhpa nama châ thei nawpa ta nama hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nama hlâna noh nata a mylâ ta nie awpa châ ta, noh thôhna noh taihta a y khiahta cha, mei ta rao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noh thôhna noh ta niepa a châ khiahta cha, pathaih leipa châ ta, a pyhpa châ aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A niepa cha Abeipa hmo pathaihpa a papuapaleipa vâta, a hmo paraona maoh phaoh aw ta, cha chyhsa cha a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nama râh liata sâh nama hria tita, nama lyu chhâna taihta nama hria khai awpa châ leipa ta, a kâmo chhao nama thoh awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nama kre sadô kâmo nama thoh awpa châ leipa ta, nama kre sadô liata kre zôpa namâ huah awpa châ vei. Dyhchhiepa nata chihropazy châta nama pahlôh awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Nama paru awpa châ leipa ta, dôveipa ta hmo nama tao awpa châ hra leipa ta, haipa bie namâ chho raihrie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ei moh ta haipa ta bie a taihpa ta, na Khazohpa moh na papuapalei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na vaih na tlybai awpa châ leipa ta, ano cha na hrao awpa châ vei. Raihriatuhpazy hlao pie leipa ta, azozâkhihdei nâ vao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nahpâpa chhie na sapa awpa châ leipa ta, mochaopa hmiakô liata chapiasana na so awpa châ vei. Na Khazohpa na chi awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ryureina liata â doleipa ta nama pachia awpa châ vei. Dyhchhiepa na khokhei via awpa châ leipa ta, chyhsa hmotaotheipa hmia na mo via awpa châ hra vei. Siana ta na vaih na pachia awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chyhsa kyh reipa ta na chiheihzy hry liata nâ khie awpa châ leipa ta, na vaih hrona châta chichhihpa bie nâ duakhei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Na palôh ta na unawhpa nâ hao awpa châ leipa ta, a thaileichâna liata nâ hlao hra lei nawpa ta, na vaih cha na chhorei awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Phuh na la awpa châ vei. Na chiheihzy chhyh thai leipa ta na y awpa châ leipa ta, nâma kyh nâ pachâpa hawhta na vaih kyh na pachâ awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ei bieraopazy na zyh awpa a châ. Sahroh chi hropa nata chi hropa chi na pathlasa awpa châ leipa ta, na lyu liata chi miano na chei pakaoh awpa châ hra leipa ta, pala chihropa miano sa pahlaopa chysia nâ tobi awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta a seichanô a ziakhei sala, cha seichanô cha a pahawh hapa châ sala, châhrasala chatlai mâh leipa nata khotalaina pie mâh leipa a châ khiahta cha, hriepa châ aw ei ta, seichanô cha khotalaina pie mâh leipa a châpa vâta, ama pano ta thie awpa deikua châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chapaw ta a thaileichâna hlâna châta Abeipa lâta hlâ awpa mietaku tôhpa ahmaohna poh o chhikao liata â vaw chhi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chapaw moleina chatlai nawpa ta, theihthaipa ta thaileichâna hlâna mietaku tôhpa hlâ aw ta, Abeipa hmiakô liata chatlaina a taopa aw. Chatanachata a moleina cha a ngiahthaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Kâna râh a ngia aw ei chi ta, nie awpa châta tho chi to nama loh tita, a theilâpa cha nie lei awpa chi ta nama pachâ chy awpa a châ. Nama châta kô thôh chhôh nie leipa chi a châ aw. Nie cheita awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tho thei zydua cha a kô palihna liata pathaih khai aw ta, Abeipa reithaina châta hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kô pangawhna kô ta a theilâpazy nama nie thei aw. Chatanachata theilâpa kôzy cha nama châta a pathei hluh via lymâ aw. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“A thisaih chhaota khâpa hmah nama nie awpa châ vei. Dyuzy nama tao awpa châ leipa ta, pachaopazy nama hmâ awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na siahli padôpa ta na luh nâ ngyu awpa châ leipa ta, na kâhhmi paizy na tai awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Athihpa châta nama pôhpa nama â awpa châ leipa ta, nama pôhpa nama chapai awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Na sawchanô cha âzuahnô ta taopa ta na papuapalei awpa châ vei. Chataleipatala râh cha âzuahnô râh ta vaw châ aw ta, moleina ta a bie pathlei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ei Pahânohzy chay aw ei chi ta, ei supathaihpa nama chiza awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Peihthaipa tlyma, ahripa lâta pachaothaipa tlyma pangai leipa u la, chazy liata a papuapalei awpa ta âmo cha tlua hra khah u. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Luh pawhpa hmiakô liata nâ duah tyh awpa châ ta, machâpa hmia za aw chi ta, Khazohpa na chi awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Chihropa nama râh liata khih a sapa ama y khiahta cha, a chô liata â doleipa ta nama tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chihropa nama hnohta khih a sapa cha, nama râh chyhsa pakha hawhta nama pachâ awpa châ ta, nâma kyh nâ pachâpa hawhta a kyh na pachâ awpa a châ. Nâmo chhao Izi râh liata chihropa nama châpa kha a thei thlâh ha teh u. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Pachiana kyh liata zy, a seihna thliena liata zy, â hrina khopathliahna liata zy, panuana liata zy â doleipa ta nama tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khopathliahna dopa, khopathliahna lô dopa, kachu dopa, chhiehraôh dopa nama hmâ awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa, Izi râh tawhta châ chhi papuatuhpa ei kha ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chavâta ei bieraopa zydua nata ei ryhpa zydua a pyh aw ei chi ta, nama zyh awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy hetana heta chho heih teh: Izarei saw tlyma, Izarei râh liata a pahrâpa chihropa tlyma, a saw Môleka lâta a piepa cha thie thlyu awpa châ ta, râh chyhsa zawpi ta alô ta vawhsao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei tlai chhao ta, cha chyhsa cha a heihnao aw na ta, a saw Môleka lâ piepa ta, ei supathaihpa cha pathaih leipa ta tao ta, ei moh pathaihpa a papuapaleipa vâta, a phopi tawhta ei chhawh pathlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A saw Môleka lâta a hlâpa cha, râhsaw zawpi ta pahno lei a pachâ ei sala, ama thie vei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cha chyhsa nata a phoheihzy cha keima tlai ta a heihnao aw ei na ta, ano chhao, Môleka lâ â zuana kyh liata ano a pazituhpa zydua chhao, ama phopi tawhta ei chhawh pathlah aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Apeihpazy nata ahripa lâta pachaona a taopazy pangaipa ta, âmo pazipa ta a sihryhpa cha, cha chyhsa cha a heihnao aw na ta, a phopi tawhta ei chhawh pathlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta a pathai u la, pathaihpa ta y teh u. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa châ tlôh na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei bieraopazy a pyh u la, zyh teh u. Kei he Abeipa , nâmo châ pathaisatuhpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nô tlyma, a paw tlyma, chhie a sapa cha thie thlyu awpa a châ. A nô tlyma, a paw tlyma chhie a sapa vâta, a thisaih maoh a phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ahy rai chyhsa lapinô liata tlyma, a vaih lapinô liata tlyma â phei khiahta cha, apheipaw nata apheinô cha ama pano ta thie thlyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A paw lapinô a ziakheipa cha, a paw dua a thliapa châ ta, ama pano ta thie thlyu awpa a châ. Ama thisaih maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chyhsa ta a myuhnô â ziakhei khiahta cha, ama pano ta thie thlyu awpa a châ. Molei chotlua a chohpa châ ei ta, ama thisaih maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chyhsa ta chanô a ziakheipa hawhta chapaw â ziakhei khiahta cha, ama pano ta hmo pasichhih ngaitapa a taopa châ ei ta, thie thlyu awpa ama châ. Ama thisaih maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chyhsa ta chanô nata a nô lapinô ta a hnei pakaoh khiah ei ta cha, molei ngaitapa châ ta, nama hry liata moleina a y lei nawpa ta, cha chyhsa nata chanôzy cha mei ta raosao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chyhsa ta sahroh a ykhei khiahta cha, cha chyhsa cha thie thlyu awpa châ ta, sahroh chhao cha nama thie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chanô ta sahroh â paykheisa khiahta cha, chanô nata sahroh cha na thie awpa a châ. Thie thlyu awpa ama châ, ama thisaih maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta a sietanô, a paw sawchanô tlyma, a nô sawchanônô tlyma hneipa ta, a sietanô thluahruana hmôpa ta, a sietanô chhao ta a rilâhpa thluahruana a hmô khiahta cha, nozachhih ngaitapa châ ta, ama phopi chyhsazy mohmô liata pahleipadia awpa ama châ. A sietanô thluahruana a palâpa châ ta, a paraona maoh a phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chyhsa ta chanô hnopasu daihti liata a ziakheipa ta a thluahruana a palâ khiahta cha, a chanô thihnawh thluahruana a palâpa châ ta, chanô chhao ta a thihnawh a palâpa châ ta, ama pano ta ama phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na nô narônô hno tlyma, na paw sietanô hno tlyma, na ty awpa châ vei. Chhôhkha sipa hnotypa châ ta, ama pano ta ama hmo paraona maoh ama phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chyhsa ta a paw unawhpa lapinô â ziakhei khiahta cha, a paw unawhpa dua thliapa châ ta, ama pano ta ama moleina maoh ama phaoh aw. Saw hnei leipa ta ama thi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chyhsa ta a unawhpa lapinô a hnei khiahta cha, hmo pathaih leipa a châ. A unawhpa dua a thliapa châ ta, saw hnei leipa ta ama thi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chavâta ei bieraopa zydua nata ei ryhpa zydua a pyh aw ei chi ta, nama zyh awpa a châ. Chatanachata pahrâ nawpa ta ei cha tlôkheina râh ta cha pali aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nama hmia lâta ei papua hapa phopi taoziezy nama zi awpa châ vei. Cha hmo zydua cha tao tyh ei ta, chavâta ei pasi ngaita ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nâmo hnohta deikua cha, ‘Ama râh, sâhpiti nata kheihti lona râh cha, ryu ta to aw ei chi ta, nama hnei awpa ta ei cha pie aw ei,’ tahpa ta bie ei châ taih ei. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa, phopizy hry tawhta nâmo châ pananotuhpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chavâta sa pathaihpa nata pathaih leipa, pavaw pathaihpa nata pathaih leipa nama panano awpa a châ. Sa tlyma, pavaw tlyma, alei liata alyhpasa tlyma, nama châta pathaih leipa ta ei pananopazy niepa ta, nama hrona cha pasichhihpa ta nama tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ei châta nama pathaih awpa a châ. Kei, Abeipa he pathaih tlôh na ta, kei eih châ awpa ta, phopizy hry tawhta ei cha panano ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Chapaw rai, chanô rai, peihthaipa nata ahripa lâta pachaona a taopa cha thie thlyu awpa châ ta, alô ta vawhsao awpa a châ. Ama thisaih maoh ama phaoh aw,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta, “Arawna sawchapaw theihthaipazy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Theihthaipa cha, a chiheihzy hry liata athihpa vâta â papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chhôhkha sipa, a nô tlyma, a paw tlyma, a sawchapaw tlyma, a sawchanô tlyma, a unawhpa tlyma,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a sietanô laihsa kôpa tlyma tah leipa ta cha, athihpa vâta â papuapalei awpa châ vei. Dyhchâ leipa a sietanô laihsa kôpa vâta deikua cha â papuapalei thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Theihthaipa cha a chiheihzy hry liata pawhrâh chaipa a châpa vâta, pathaih leipa ta a taopa ta, â papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theihthaipazy cha luh pôlôpa ta ama sâ amâ ngyu awpa châ leipa ta, ama kâhhmi kâ lâ ama tai awpa châ hra leipa ta, ama pôhpa ama â awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama Khazohpa châta ama pathaih awpa châ ta, ama Khazohpa moh ama papuapalei awpa châ vei. Khazohpa tovyuh a niepa châ ei ta, Abeipa lâta hmohlâpazy mei ta a hlâ tyhpa ama châpa vâta, ama pathaih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Theihthaipa cha a Khazohpa châta chyhsa pathaihpa a châpa vâta, âzuahnô tlyma, chanô papuapalei hapa tlyma ama hnei awpa châ vei. A vahpa nata a chhaihpa chanô chhao ama hnei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na Khazohpa viahchhâ a hlâpa a châpa vâta, na châta chyhsa pathaihpa ta na rao awpa a châ. Kei, Abeipa nâmo cha pathaisatuhpa he pathaih tlôh na ta, chavâta theihthaipa cha chyhsa pathaihpa ta na pachâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Theihthaipa sawchanô ta a zuah sala, â papuapalei khiahta cha, a paw a papuapaleipa châ ta, mei ta raosao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Theihthai beichaipa châ awpa ta a unawhzy hry tawhta panano hapa nata, a luh liata sathaw pathaihpa bao hapa nata theihthaipa chysia a tobi awpa ta panano hapa cha, a sâ a pathliah awpa châ leipa ta, a chysiazy a hrie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Athihpa ri yna liata â ngia awpa châ leipa ta, a nô tlyma, a paw tlyma vâta chhao â papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A Khazohpa ta a pananona sathawthuna a chô liata y tlôh ta, chavâta supathaihpa tawhta a pua awpa châ vei. Chataleipatala a Khazohpa supathaihpa a papuapalei pathlei aw. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Theihthaipa cha lapinô châta laihsa kôpa a hnei awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nôhmei tlyma, a vahpa nata a chhaihpa tlyma, chanô papuapalei hapa tlyma, âzuahnô tlyma a hnei awpa châ vei. Ano chiheih laihsa kôpa lapinô ta a hnei awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata a pathlazy cha a chiheihzy hry liata papuapalei leipa ta a y aw. Kei he Abeipa ano pathaisatuhpa cha ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Arawna chho la, a hnohta hetana heta reih teh: ‘Chhâ vaw y lymâ awpa liata, na pathlazy hry liata a khaihly leipa cha, a Khazohpa viahchhâ hlâ awpa ta â hnia awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A khaihly leipa maih, mochaopa, pheisypa, hmia pizie doleipa, ku phei seih tupa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />phei tliepa, ku tliepa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />zôh kopa, heih a kho leipa mataw tupa, mo liata adoleina a hneipa, hmahchaku a hneipa, thachhâpa nata tihmô keipazy cha, ama Khazohpa viahchhâ hlâ awpa ta amâ hnia awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Theihthaipa Arawna pathla a khaihly leipa cha Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa hlâ awpa ta â hnia awpa châ vei. A khaihly leipa a châpa vâta, a Khazohpa viahchhâ hlâ awpa ta â hnia awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A Khazohpa viahchhâ pathaih chaipa nata hmo pathaihpazy cha a nie thei khai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A khaihly leipa a châpa vâta, pohraipa deikua siepahlie thei leipa aw ta, ei supathaihpazy a papuapalei lei nawpa ta, maisâh kiapâh lâ vawh thei aw vei. Kei he Abeipa âmo pathaisatuhpa ei châ,’” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Mawsi ta Arawna nata a sawchapawzy nata Izarei saw zydua hnohta reih ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Arawna nata a sawchapawzy chho la, ei moh pathaihpa ama papuapalei lei nawpa ta, Izarei sawzy ta hmo pathaihpa kei lâta ama hlâpa tawhta a panano awpa ta âmo cha chho teh. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Nama chhâ zydua liata, nama pathla ahy rai ta pathaih leina hneina chôta, Izarei sawzy ta Abeipa lâta ama hlâpa, hmohlâpa pathaihpa â hnia khiahta cha, cha theihthaipa cha ei hmiakô tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arawna pathla ahy rai phawhpa tlyma, hniah lohpa tlyma a châ khiahta cha, a pathaih hlâlei hmo pathaihpazy a nie awpa châ vei. Athihpa a hriapa, a baoti a puapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />alyhpasa pathaih leipa a hriapa nata pathaih leina paka theipa a hneipa chyhsa hriapa zy vâta â papuapaleipa theihthaipa cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zâlâ taih pathaih leipa a châ aw. Ti liata a ngai â si ha tua leipa ta cha, hmo pathaihpazy a nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noh a tla nahta pathaih aw ta, cha khai tawhta hmo pathaihpazy a nie thei aw, chazy cha ano nie awpa a châpa vâta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Theihthaipa cha, ano kho ta a thipa sa tlyma, sahrâhpa ta a taipa tlyma niepa ta â papuapalei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chavâta ei biepiepazy amâ pyh awpa a châ. Chataleipatala ei hmo pathaihpa ama papuapaleipa vâta ama moleina maoh phaoh aw ei ta, ama thi pathlei aw. Kei he Abeipa âmo pathaisatuhpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Chyhsa zawrâpa ta hmo pathaihpa a nie awpa châ leipa ta, theihthaipa khichhai chihropa nata theihthaipa rai hriatuhpazy chhao, hmo pathaihpa ama nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta ano sôh ta a chaleipa sei deikua cha, hmo pathaihpa a nie thei aw. Theihthaipa o liata a pihpa chhao, theihthaipa pati a nie thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theihthaipa sawchanô ta chyhsa zawrâpa a hnei khiahta cha, hmohlâpa pathaihpazy a nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Theihthaipa sawchanô a nôhmeipa tlyma, a vahpa ta a mapa tlyma, saw hnei leipa ta a paw o lâ a kua khiahta deikua cha, a laihsa no hawhta a paw pati a nie heih thei aw. Chyhsa zawrâpa deikua theihthaipa pati pathaihpa a nie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chyhsa ta pahno leipa ta hmo pathaihpa a nie pathlei ha khiahta cha, a mâ su pangawh su kha baichha aw ta, hmo pathaihpa cha theihthaipa hnohta a pie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theihthaipazy ta Izarei sawzy Abeipa lâta hmohlâpa pathaihpazy ama papuapalei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chataleipatala hmo pathaihpazy niepa ta ama thaileichâna maoh ama phaoh pathlei aw. Kei he Abeipa âmo pathaisatuhpa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Arawna nata a sawchapawzy nata Izarei saw zydua chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Izarei pathla tlyma, Izarei râh liata a ypa chihropa tlyma, a hmohlâpa a vaw chei tita, ama bietai hmohlâpa rai châ sala, lôhthai hmohlâpa rai châ sala, raopa hlâna châta Abeipa lâta ama vaw cheipa maih cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />nama hlâpa a pyhpa a châ thei nawpa ta, viahchao tlyma, mietaku tlyma, mie tlyma, a chapawpa seina hnei leipa nama hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Seina a hneipa rai nama hlâ awpa châ vei. Cha hawhpa cha nama châta a pyh tlâh châ aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahy rai a bietai patlô nawpa ta Abeipa lâta aryhna hlâna châta tlyma, lôhthai hmohlâpa châta tlyma, atheihna a hlâ tita, a py tlâh a châ thei nawpa ta, viahchao hri tawhta tlyma, mietaku zaw tawhta tlyma, seina hnei leipa a hlâ awpa a châ. Sahroh cha seina rai a hnei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sahroh mochaopazy, ru tliepazy, asypazy, hmahphaohpazy, hmahchaku a hneipazy nata thachhâpazy Abeipa lâta nama hlâ awpa châ vei. Maisâh liata niepa hlâna châta Abeipa lâ nama pie awpa châ hra vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lôhthai hmohlâpa châta viahchao tôhpa tlyma, mietakutaw tlyma, kuphei seih tupa tlyma, chyu tupa tlyma hlâ thei aw ei chi ta, bietai patlô nawpa ta hmohlâpa châta deikua, cha hawpa cha a pyhpa châ aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sahroh a tihmô thi dôpa tlyma, chhuhchheihpa tlyma, pakeipa tlyma, hri lyupa tlyma, Abeipa lâta nama hlâ awpa châ vei. Cha hawhpa hmo cha nama râh liata nama tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cha hawhpa sahrohzy cha chihropa tawhta lapa ta, nama Khazohpa nie awpa ta nama hlâ awpa châ vei. Raona âmo liata y ta, seina ama hneipa vâta, nama châta a pyhpa châ aw vei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Viahchao tôhpa tlyma, mietaku tlyma, mie tlyma a pataw nahta, a panô hnohta noh sari y aw ta, a noh chariena noh tawhta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa châta a pyh theipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Viahchao panô tlyma, mietaku panô tlyma, a taw chhaota noh kha ta nama thie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abeipa lâta alyna biereina atheihna nama hlâ tita, a pyh tlâh châ awpa ta atheihna cha nama hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Namâ theihna noh ta nie khai ha awpa châ ta, a mylâ my taihta khâpa hmah nama so awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ei biepiepazy he zyhpa ta nama tao awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Izarei sawzy hry liata pathaisapa ta ei y thei nawpa ta, ei moh pathaihpa nama papuapalei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa nâmo châ pathaisatuhpa châ na ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />nama Khazohpa châ awpa ta Izi râh tawhta châ chhi papuatuhpa ei châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Hezy he Abeipa châta kyhchhi raopa, pakhypi pathaihpa ta nama phuah awpa châ ta, chazy cha keima raopa kyhchhizy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Noh charu chhôh rai hria awpa châ ta, a noh sarina noh deikua cha apahâna zachhihpa Pahânoh, pakhypi pathaihpa noh a châ aw. Khâpa rai hmah nama hria awpa châ vei. Cha cha nama pahrâna maih liata Abeipa châta Pahânoh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hezy he Abeipa châta kyhchhi raopa, pakhypi pathaihpa châ ta, hmâh awpa ta a daihti raopa liata nama phuah tyh awpa a châ:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thla khana, noh hrawh hleipalihna noh zâlâ a zoh chy daihti cha Abeipa Zawpakhô kyhchhi a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cha thla pyly liata, noh hrawh hleipangawhna noh cha Abeipa châta viahchhâ thinô pahlao leipa kyhchhi châ ta, noh sari chhôh viahchhâ thinô pahlao leipa nama nie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A noh khana noh ta pakhypi pathaihpa hmâh aw ei chi ta, rai rupa nama hria awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noh sari chhôh mei ta hmohlâpa Abeipa lâta nama hlâ awpa châ ta, a noh sarina noh cha pakhypi pathaihpa châ ta, rai rupa nama hria awpa châ vei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chatawhcha Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Râh ei cha piepa ei tlô aw ei chi ta, a kôvei sâh nama hria tita, nama sâh a daih tuapazy tawhta sapiah miakha theihthaipa lâ nama vaw cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pyhpa nama châ thei nawpa ta, theihthaipa ta sapiah cha a chaluah aw. Pahânoh mylâ ta Abeipa hmiakô liata a chaluah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sapiah nama chaluah noh ta, mietakutaw chapawpa kô khapa, seina hnei leipa cha, raopa hlâna ta Abeipa lâta nama hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Niepa hlâna viahdie dipa sathaw pahlaopa kachu su hrawh su no hlâ pâ awpa châ ta, cha cha ropahâhpa châta Abeipa lâta mei ta raopa hmohlâpa a châ aw. Dopa hlâna châta kresawhti chhiehraôh ôh palih hlâ pâ hra awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nama Khazohpa lâta nama hlâna noh a tlô hlâlei cha, chi thiehpa viahchhâ tlyma, raopa tlyma, a suh tlyma, nama nie awpa châ vei. Cha cha nama chhâ zydua châta nama pahrâna zydua liata chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pahânoh mylâ ta chaluahpa hlâna sapiah nama vaw chei noh tawhta reih aw ei chi ta, Pahânoh ei sari a tloh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pahânoh ei sarina my taihta noh sypangawh reih aw ei chi ta, niepa hlâna sâh thiehpa cha Abeipa lâ nama hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chaluahpa hlâna ta Abeipa lâ thei hmiatuapazy hlâ awpa ta, nama pahrâna suzy tawhta, viahchhâ tlâ no nata viahdie dipa thinô pahlaopa ta taopa kachu su hrawh su no nama cheih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Viahchhâ hlâ nota, mietakutaw kô khapa seina hnei leipa pô sari, viahchao tôh dawpa pô kha nata mietaku tôhpa pô no nama hlâ awpa a châ. Chazy cha Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna châ aw ta, ama niepa hlâna nata ama dopa hlânazy chhaota Abeipa lâta raopa hlâna ropahâh ngaitapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Moleina hlâna châta mie tôhpa pô kha nata aryhna hlâna atheihna châta mietakutaw chapawpa kô khapa pô no nama hlâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta thei hmiatuapa viahchhâ cha, mietakutaw pô no chhaota, chaluahpa hlâna ta Abeipa hmiakô liata a chaluah aw. Chazy cha Abeipa châta pathaihpa châ ta, theihthaipa tovyuh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha noh lia tlai ta nama châta pakhypi pathaihpa phuah aw ei chi ta, rai rupa khâpa hmah nama hria awpa châ vei. Cha cha nama chhâ zydua châta nama pahrâna zydua liata chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Nama lyu liata sâh nama hria tita, nama lyu chaki chakô taihta nama hria khai awpa châ leipa ta, kâmo chhao nama thoh awpa châ vei. Dyhchhiepa nata chihropazy châta nama pahlôh awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Thla sarina, cha thla noh khana noh cha nama châta apahâna zachhihpa noh châ ta, chiahmie tôpa ta atheithlâhna noh ta phuah aw ei chi ta, pakhypi pathaihpa hmâna noh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rai rupa nama hria awpa châ leipa ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa nama hlâ awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Thla sarina noh hrawhna noh cha Chatlaina Noh châ ta, nama châta pakhypi pathaihpa châ aw ta, a paky aw ei chi ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa nama hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha noh cha, chatlaina noh châ ta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa hmiakô liata nama châta chatlaina taona noh a châpa vâta, khâpa rai hmah nama hria awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cha noh liata a paky leipa cha, a phopi tawhta chhawh pathlahpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahy rai châ sala, cha noh liata rai kheihawhpa rai a hriapa cha, a phopi tawhta ei pahleipadia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khâpa rai hmahta nama hria awpa châ vei. Cha cha nama chhâ zydua châta nama pahrâna zydua liata chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cha noh cha nama châta a pahâ nawpa Pahânoh zachhihpa châ aw ta, namâ pakyna noh a châ aw. Cha thla, noh chakina noh zâlâ tawhta zâlâ heihpa taih cha Pahânoh ta nama chay awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: He thla sarina, noh hrawh hleipangawhna noh he, Abeipa lâta noh sari chhôh Byureih Kyhchhi hmâna nohzy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A noh khana cha pakhypi pathaihpa châ aw ta, rai rupa nama hria awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Noh sari chhôh Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa hlâ aw ei chi ta, a noh chariena noh cha nama châta pakhypi pathaihpa châ aw ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa nama hlâ awpa a châ. Cha cha pakhypi pathaihpa châ ta, rai rupa nama hria awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Hezy he Abeipa châta kyhchhi raopazy châ ta, pakhypi pathaihpa daihti liata nama phuah awpazy a châ: Raopa hlânazy, niepa hlânazy, atheihnazy nata dopa hlânazy cha a noh raopa chyu liata hlâ awpa châ ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta raopa hmohlâpazy nama hlâ nawpa kyhchhi daihtizy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chazy cha Abeipa Pahânohzy liata pie awpa nama hmosaipiepazy, nama bietai zydua nata nama lôhthai hmopiepa zydua khô lâta Abeipa lâta nama pie awpazy a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“A thla sarina, noh hrawh hleipangawhna noh, nama lyu liata kôveizy nama hria khai tawhta, Abeipa kyhchhi noh sari chhôh hmâh aw ei chi ta, a noh khana noh cha apahâna noh zachhihpa châ aw ta, a noh chariena noh chhao apahâna noh zachhihpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A noh khana noh ta tho phapa theizy, thiahrâ kuahzy, thochiah buh phapa nata chavah liata râbuhzy a chaba aw ei chi ta, Abeipa nama Khazohpa hmiakô liata noh sari chhôh thaphapa ta nama y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cha cha Abeipa lâta kyhchhi châta kô chareih noh sari chhôh nama chay tyh awpa châ ta, nama chhâ zydua châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw. Thla sarina liata nama chay tyh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Byureih liata noh sari chhôh y aw ei chi ta, a râh chyhsa Izarei saw zydua cha byureihzy liata pahrâ khai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chatanachata nama chhâ vaw y lymâ awpazy ta, Izarei sawzy Izi râh tawhta ei chhi papua nota byureih liata ei paysapa ei ama pahno thei aw. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Mawsi ta Abeipa kyhchhi daihti raopazy cha Izarei sawzy hnohta phuah ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khazohpa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Meiôh cha khâ a khaih thei nawpa ta, ôli thaw saohpa pasohpa nâ lâta vaw cheih awpa ta Izarei sawzy hetana heta biepie teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahmaohna poh o liata Biehrai Byh pohraipa khôtho liata, meiôh cha zâlâ tawhta my taihta Abeipa hmiakô liata pakhaih tyh awpa ta, Arawna ta soh tyh mawh sy. Cha cha nama chhâ vaw y lymâ awpazy châta chhâzaw bieraopa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Meiôhzy cha ngôh suapa ta taopa meiôh sona chô liata Abeipa hmiakô ta khaih pazao awpa ta Arawna ta a soh tyh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Viahdie dipa la aw chi ta, cha chata viahchhâ tlâ hrawh hleino na tao aw. Viahchhâ tlâ kha châta viahdie kachu su hrawh su no lymâ hmâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abeipa hmiakô liata tlâhkhai pathaihpa chô liata tlâh no ta paziah aw chi ta, tlâh kha liata viahchhâ tlâ charu lymâ ta na paziah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Viahchhâ chô liana cha, a tlâh no liata deiryh pasoh ngaitapa soh aw chi ta, cha cha viahchhâ vyuhpa ta atheithlâhna hmo châta châ aw ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pahânoh maihta Arawna ta viahchhâ cha Abeipa hmiakô liata soh lymâ aw ta, cha cha Izarei sawzy tawhta ama chhâzaw biehrai châta ama piepa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha cha Arawna nata a sawchapawzy tovyuh châ aw ta, Abeipa lâta mei ta hmohlâpazy tawhta chhâzaw châta ama tovyuh pathaihpa a châpa vâta, su pathaihpa liata ama nie awpa a châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chyhsa pakha, a nô Izarei chyhsa, a paw Izi chyhsa cha, Izarei sawzy yna lâ vawh ta. Cha Izarei chanô sawchapawpa nata Izarei chyhsa pakha cha riehmo liata a tu ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izarei chanô sawchapawpa chata Moh reipachhiepa ta chhie sa ta. Mawsi lâ a chhi ei ta, a nô moh cha Selômi châ ta, ano cha Dânâ chi Dibri sawchanô a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abeipa pakah tawhta bie a puapa hâpa ta patâhna liata khô chy ei ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chhiesatuhpa kha riehmo khôtho lâ a chhi u la, a biereipa a theipa zydua ta a luh liata ama ku pahnieh ei sala, zawpi zydua ta alô ta vawh mawh ei sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta, ahy rai a Khazohpa chhie a sapa cha, a moleina maoh a phaoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abeipa moh a reipachhiepa cha thie thlyu awpa châ ta, zawpi zydua ta alô ta ama vawh awpa a châ. Chihropa chhao, a râh chyhsa chhao, Moh a reipachhie khiahta cha thie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Thina taihta chyhsa chô liata ku a pathlapa cha thie thlyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thina taihta sahroh chô liata ku a pathlapa cha thô aw ta, sahroh vyuhpa ta sahroh a thô aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chyhsa ta a vaih hmah a paphao khiahta cha, a taopa hawhta a chô liata tao hra awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ru tliepa vyuhpa ta ru tliepa, mo vyuhpa ta mo, hâh vyuhpa ta hâh châ aw ta, chyhsa hmah a paphaopa hawhta, ano chhao hmah paphao awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sahroh a thiepa cha thô aw ta, chyhsa a thiepa cha ano chhao thie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chihropazy châta nata a râh chyhsazy châta ryhpa â lyupa ta nama hnei awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata Mawsi ta Izarei sawzy cha chho ta, chhiesatuhpa cha riehmo khôtho lâ a chhi ei ta, Mawsi hnohta Abeipa biepiepa hawhta Izarei sawzy ta tao ei ta, alô ta ama vawhsao haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Sinai Tlâh liata Mawsi hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Râh ei cha piepa ei nama tlô tita, râh ta Abeipa châta Pahânoh a chay hra awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lyu liata kô charu chhôh chi cheih aw chi ta, na kre sadô chhao kô charu chhôh a chiah chhawhpa ta panyusa aw chi ta, a theizy na hria aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kô sarina kô deikua cha râh châta apahâna noh pathaihpa, Abeipa châta Pahânoh châ aw ta, na lyu liata chi na chei awpa châ leipa ta, na kre sadô chhao a chiah chhawhpa ta na panyusa awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na sâh sawhlipa na hria awpa châ leipa ta, na mohôh leipa kre thei chhao na lyu awpa châ vei. Cha cha râh châta apahâna pathaihpa kô a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râh â pahâ kô ta chicheipa a patheipazy cha nama nie chhyhpa châta a châ aw. Nâ nata na seichapaw nata na seichanôzy, châ hriahlaopazy, na hnohta a ypa chihropazy,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />na viahchao hri nata na râh liata sahrohzy châta châ aw ta, lyu nata sadô liata a patheipa zydua cha, nie chhyhpa châta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Chatawhcha a pahâ kô kô sari reipati aw chi ta, kô sari cha su sari ta papôhsapa châ aw ta, chatanachata a pahâ kô kô sari cha kô sypalih nata kô chaki a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cha tawhta thla sarina, noh hrawhna noh ta chiahmie paro ngaitapa ta patôsa aw chi ta, nama râh zydua liata chiahmie tôpa ta chatlaina noh nama phuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kô sypangawhna a ly aw ei chi ta, râh pôhpalôh liata a pahrâpa zydua hnohta khotalaina nama phuah aw. Cha cha nama châta zubili châ aw ta, chyhsa to nama râh chyu lâta kua aw ei chi ta, mo to nama chhôhkha chyu lâ namâ lie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kô sypangawhna cha nama châta zubili châ aw ta, chi cheih leipa aw ei chi ta, a sawhlipa chhao la leipa aw ei chi ta, kre zôh mohôh leipa liata kre thei chhao nama lyu awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zubili kô châ ta, nama châta a pathaih awpa a châ. Lyurâhpa liata a pyuhpazy deita nama nie awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Cha zubili kô liata chyhsa to âmo râh chyu ama hnei heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Na vaih hnohta râh na zua khiahta tlyma, na vaih râh na chalei khiahta tlyma, namâ dôvei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zubili tawhta reipatipa ta, a kô ziepa lymâ hawhta na vaih hnohta râh mâ pie aw chi ta, chi chei nawpa kô zie reipatipa ta, na vaih ta na hnohta râh a zuah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kô hluhna zie lymâ ta a mâ papôh aw chi ta, a kô chyhna zie lymâ ta a mâ na pahnai aw. Chi chei nawpa kô ziepa a laichadaipa ta na hnohta a zua awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Namâ dôvei awpa châ vei. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa châ tlôh na ta, na Khazohpa cha na chi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Chavâta ei bieraopazy zyhpa ta, ei ryhpazy a pyh u la, chazy cha nama tao awpa a châ. Chatanachata râh liata thlalôhpa ta nama pahrâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Râh ta a thei pathei aw ta, lôhrâtlôpa ta nie aw ei chi ta, thlalôhpa ta nama y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘A kô sarina kô liata khâpa eima nie aw? Chi cheih tlôh leipa pi ta, chavâta sâh eima hria awpa y aw vei’ nama tah thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kô charuna kô liata ei byhnâ nama chô liata patlôsa aw na ta, kô thôh a daih awpa ta kô a veih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kô chariena kô ta chi cheih aw ei chi ta, sâh hlôpa nama pachôpazy nie aw ei chi ta, kô chakina taih, sâh thiehpa â daih heih hlâlei sâh hlôpa nama nie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Râh cha nama zuah pathlah awpa châ vei. Râh cha kei eih châ ta, nâmo cha khichhaipa nata khitlyhpa, ei râh liata a pahrâ chypa dei nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Râh nama chaleipa zydua cha, râh hneituhpa ta a chatlai pakhua awpa nama pasaih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Na unawhpa a dyh vaw chhie sala, a râh thokha a zuah khiahta cha, a heinawh a hnia chaipa ta a unawhpa zuapa râh cha a chatlai awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chyhsa ahy tlyma cha, a râh a chatlaipa awpa hnei leipa sala, châhrasala vaw hneirôhpa ta, chatlaina khi sôh a hnei khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a zuana kô tawhta a laichadaipa ta, râh ta kôvei a papua thei awpa zie reipatipa châ aw ta, râh a zuana mâ zie a tloh leipa khiahta cha, râh a chaleituhpa hnohta a mâ pakua aw ta, a râh cha a hnei heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chatlai pakhua heih awpa ta a hneina ta â daih vei khiahta deikua cha, râh a zua hapa cha chaleituhpa ku liata zubili kô taih y aw ta, zubili kô ta râh cha pua aw ta, a râh cha a hnei heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Thokhy a hneipa khihpi liata chyhsa ta a o a zuah khiahta cha, a zua tawhta kô kha chhôh ta a chatlai heih thei aw. Kô kha bohloh chhôh chatlai theina daihti a hnei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kô kha chhôh ta a chatlai thei leipa khiahta cha, thokhy hneipa khihpi liata a o cha, chaleituhpa ta hnei pathlah aw ta, a pathlazy ta ama hnei lymâ aw. Zubili liata chhao pua khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Thokhy a hnei leipa khitawzy liata ozy deikua cha, râh liata lyu hawhta pachâpa châ aw ta, chatlai theipa a châ aw. Zubili liata chhao a pua thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Livai chizy deikua cha, Livai khihpizy liata o ama hneipazy khatino rai ta ama chatlai thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Livai chi ta a o zuah sala, chatlai pakhua awpa a khoh khiahta cha, Livai khihpizy liata ozy cha Livai chizy ta Izarei sawzy hry liata olyu ama hnei chhôhpa a châpa vâta, Livai khihpi liata o zuapa cha Zubili liata a pua awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Livai khihpizy chheipâh liata lyuzy deikua cha, chhâzaw châta ama ryuto râh a châpa vâta, zuah theipa châ aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Na unawhpa a dyh vaw chhie sala, a châ vaw chhai khiahta cha, na deichhy awpa a châ. Khichhaipa nata khitlyhpa na deichhypa hawhta, na hnohta na paysa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Apôhna tlyma, âthôhna tlyma, ano tawhta na la awpa châ vei. Na Khazohpa chi mah y, chatanachata na unawhpa cha na hnohta a y thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Apôhna chhaota na sôh dyu na pacheisa awpa châ leipa ta, athôhna tluapa ta niedo na pie awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa, Kâna râh cha pie awpa nata nama Khazohpa châ awpa ta, Izi râh tawhta châ chhi papuatuhpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Na unawhpa a dyh vaw chhie sala, na hnohta sei ta â zuah khiahta cha, sei hawhta na tao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hriahlaopa hawhta nata khichhaipa hawhta na hnohta a y awpa a châ. Zubili kô taihta a cha chakao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cha khai tawhta, a sawzy chhaota nâ tawhta pua aw ta, a chiheih lâ kua aw ta, a pathlatuhpazy râh liata a pahrâ heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Âmo cha Izi râh tawhta ei chhi papuapa, nâ chakaotuhpazy châ ei ta, sei zuapa hawhta zuah awpa châ veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nôchhiepa ta a chô liata ryu na rei awpa châ vei. Na Khazohpa na chi awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Seichapaw nata seichanôzy nama hnei khoh khiahta cha, nama chheipâh râhzy tawhta nama chalei awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nama hry liata a pahrâpa chihropazy nata nama râh liata a pihpa ama chiheihzy hry tawhta chhao chalei thei aw chi ta, âmo cha na hmohneipa ama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Âmo cha, châ vaw pazi awpa nama sawzy châta ama chhâzaw ryuto nata hmohneipa ta tao aw ei chi ta, ama phopi tawhta sei nama hnei lymâ aw. Nama unawhpa Izarei sawzy chô liata deikua, nôchhiepa ta ryu nama rei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />“Chihropa tlyma, khichhaipa nama hry liata a pahrâpa tlyma, vaw hneirôh sala, a kiapâh liata na unawhpa a dyh vaw chhie sala, na unawhpa chata chihropa hnohta tlyma, khichhaipa nama hry liata a pahrâpa hnohta tlyma, chihropa pathla chhôhkhapa hnohta tlyma, sei ta â zuah khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />zuapa a châ khai tawh chhao ta chatlai heih theipa a châ aw. A unawhzy hry liatapa ta a chatlai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A paw unawhpa tlyma, a paw unawhpa sawchapaw tlyma ta chatlai thei aw ta, a chiheihzy hry liata a heinawh a hniapa chhao ta a chatlai thei aw. Ano chhao ta, a vaw hneirôh khiahta cha, anosasyh ta â chatlai thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ano nata chaleituhpa ta, sei ta â zuana kô tawhta zubili taih reipati aw ei ta, chatlai nawpa mâ cha a kô ziepa hawhta châ aw ta, hriahlaopa ta cha daihti chhôh ta a hlao awpa zie hawhta a laichadaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Kô hluhpi a byuh chy khiahta cha, chaleituhpa ta â phuhpa ta chatlaina mâ a pakua aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Zubili kô tlô nawpa ta kô chyhta dei a y khiahta deikua cha, a laichadai aw ei ta, kô a y chypa zie hawhta chatlaina mâ cha a pakua awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kô kha lymâ châta pahriasapa hriatuhpa hawhta a hnohta a y awpa a châ. Na mohmô liata nôchhiepa ta a chô liata ryu a rei awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata chatlaipa a châ leipa chhao ta, zubili kô liata cha, a sawzy chhaota a pua awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Izarei sawzy cha kei nâ chakaopazy châ ei ta, Izi râh tawhta ei chhi papuapa nâ chakaotuhpazy ama châ. Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa ei châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Khazoh nothlahpa namâ tao awpa châ leipa ta, nothlahpa tao chhyhpa tlyma, lôbô tlyma, nama bô awpa châ hra leipa ta, a naoh awpa ta nama râh liata nothlahpa hawhta taopa alô nama bô awpa châ vei, kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa châ tlôh na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ei Pahânohzy chay aw ei chi ta, ei supathaihpa nama chiza awpa a châ. Kei he Abeipa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ei bieraopazy zipa ta, ei biepiepazy zyhpa ta nama tao khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />avâzy a daihti ta cha pasuasapa aw ei na ta, chhaohlei ta kôvei papua aw ta, lyu liata thozy ta thei ama pathei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nama sawhri liata sâh ta kre thei lyuna daihti taih a daih aw ta, kre thei nama lyupa ta chi cheina daihti taih a daih aw ta, nama viahchhâ lôhrâtlôpa ta nie aw ei chi ta, nama râh liata thlalôh ngaitapa ta nama pahrâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râh cha thlalôhpa ta paysa aw na ta, a zia aw ei chi ta, ahy hmahta cha pachisa aw veih ei. Sahrâhpazy râh tawhta to khai aw na ta, zaozi ta nama râh chahryh aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nama chariahzy a chadai aw ei chi ta, nama hmiakô liata zaozi ta ama pao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Papangawh ta za kha a chadai aw ei chi ta, za kha ta thy kha a chadai aw ei chi ta, nama chariahpazy nama hmiakô liata zaozi ta ama pao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nâmo lâ a vaw heih aw na ta, chi hluhpi cha pathlasapa ta, cha papôh aw ei na ta, nama hnohta ei biehrai ei pa-i aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bohpi nama pasopa sâh hlôpazy nie aw ei chi ta, sâh thiehpa so nawpa ta sâh hlôpazy nama patly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nama hry liata ei byureih soh aw na ta, ei hro ta châ hao aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nama hry liata y aw na ta, nama Khazohpa châ aw na ta, ei phopi nama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei he Abeipa nama Khazohpa, Izi mo sei nama châ khao lei awpa ta, Izi râh tawhta nâmo châ chhi papuatuhpa ei châ. Nama raopakyzy thlie pachhô na ta, â patlâpa ta ei cha pasiesa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ei bie nathlie leipa ta, he biepiepa zydua he tao leipa u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ei bieraopazy zyh khoh leipa ta, nama hro ta ei ryureinazy a hao u la, ei biepiepa zydua tao leipa ta, ei biehrai nama parao khiahta deikua cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kei chhao ta nama chô liata he hmozy he ei tao aw: Nama chô liata hmo chichhihpa patlôsa aw na ta, nama mo pazohsa ta, nama hrona a pahlei theipa chaohpa hri nata chasipazy ei chareisa aw. Hraoleipa ta chi cheih aw ei chi ta, nama chariahpazy nie awpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Châ heihnao aw ei na ta, nama chariahpazy hmiakô liata nama nawh aw. Châ haotuhpazy ta nama chô liata ryureih aw ei ta, ahy hmahta châ chadai leipa ta namâ râpai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chatanachôta ei bie nama nathlie vei khiahta cha, nama moleinazy vâta ei sari ei cha hrie via aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nama thatlôna namâ palaikheipa thlie pachhô aw na ta, nama chô lâta avâzy cha thua hawhta tao aw na ta, nama ry lâta alei dawh hawhta ei tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nama tha pahryuh thlâhthli aw ei chi ta, nama râh ta kôvei papua leipa aw ta, râh liata thozy ta thei pathei aw veih ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ei kho leinazie ta ypa ta, ei bie nama nathlie vei khiahta cha, nama moleinazy hawh lymâ ta potlana a lie sari ta nama chô liata ei patlôsa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sahrâhpazy nama hry liata vaw tuah aw na ta, cha chata nama sawzy cha lapa aw ei ta, nama sahrohzy ama cha siepa aw. Maluh chyhta ta cha tao aw ei na ta, nama lâpizy cha dâh karopa ta a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Chatanachôta ei chhoreina a pyh hlei leipa ta, ei kho leizie ta khâ nama y khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />kei chhao nâmo kho leizie ta y aw na ta, keima tlai ta nama moleinazy vâta a lie sari ta ei cha hrie aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nama chô liata zaozi chareisa aw na ta, cha chata biehrai phuh la aw ta, nama khihpizy liata pahmaoh pakhypa ta nama y aw. Nama hry liata hri chareisa aw na ta, chariahpa ku liata hlâpa nama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nama viahchhâ lana lâpi ei chhie pachhô tita cha, chanô pahrawh ta viahchhâ taona beih miakha liata nama viahchhâ tao aw ei ta, nama viahchhâ cha khopathliahpa ta ama cha pie heih aw. Nie aw ei chi ta, nama rih bie hlei aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Chatanachôta ei bie nathlie hlei leipa ta, ei kho leizie ta khâ nama y khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />kei chhao hiehâhpa ta nama kho leizie ta y aw na ta, nama moleinazy vâta a lie sari ta ei cha hrie aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nama sawchapawzy sa nie aw ei chi ta, nama sawchanôzy sa nama nie aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nama su sâhpazy parao aw na ta, nama noh khazoh nothlahpazy papao aw na ta, nama khazoh nothlahpazy ri chô liata nâmo ri ei pacho aw. Ei hro ta a châ hao aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nama khihpizy cha khirypa ta tao aw na ta, nama supathaihpazy roryhrapa ta ei tao aw. Nama ropahâhpazy pahnâ khao aw va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Râh cha keima tlai ta roryhrapa ta tao aw na ta, cha liata a pahrâpa nama chariahpazy taihta noâh ama tah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Phopizy hry liata cha hiepatla aw ei na ta, ei zaozi phiapa ta ei cha chadai aw ei. Chatanachata nama râh cha roryhrapa ta y aw ta, nama khihpizy cha khirypa ama vaw châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Râh roryhrapa ta a y chhôh zydua nata nâmo nama chariahpa râh liata nama y chhôh zydua cha, râh ta Pahânohzy a hmâh aw. Chatanachata râh cha a pahâ aw ta, a Pahânohzy liata â ly aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Râh cha roryhrapa ta a y chhôh zydua â pahâ aw. Râh liata nama pahrâ chhôh ta nama Pahânohzy liata â pahâ leina vyuhpa ta â pahâ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nama hry liata laibâhpazy cha, ama chariahpazy râh liata palôh thazeipa ta ei paysa aw ei. Chhohna raohpa tlapa pyu ta âmo cha a chadai aw ta, zaozi tawhta a râpa hawhta a râpai aw ei ta, ahy ta hmahta amâ chadai leipa chhao ta ama pao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahy ta hmahta amâ chadai leipa chhao ta, zaozi ta amâ chadaipa hawhta âmo nata âmo amâ chapia aw. Nama chariahpazy hmiakô liata a duah awpa ta thatlôna rai hnei aw veih ei chi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Phopizy hry liata leidia aw ei chi ta, nama chariahpazy râh ta a cha nie khai aw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nama hry liata laibâhpazy chhao, ama paraona vâta nama chariahpazy râh liata ama leidia aw. Âmo paraona vâ dei châ vei, ama pathlatuhpazy paraona vâta ama pathlatuhpazy hawhta ama leidia aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Châhrasala ei chô liata ama paraona nata ama pathlatuhpazy paraonazy a phuahpa ta, ei kho leizie ta ama ypazy a phuah ei sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />ama paraonazy vâta ama kho leizie ta hmo tao na ta, ama chariahpazy râh lâta ei chhipa ei kha pahnopa ta, ama pathipalôh chopawtaileipa a panawh ei sala, ama hmo paraona tawhta a taopathi amâ chhuah khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Zakaw nata Aisika nata Abarahâ zy hnohta ei biehraizy kha a thei aw na ta, râh cha ei thei thlâh ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Châhrasala râh cha siesaipa ta y aw ta, âmo y leipa ta roryhrapa ta a y chhôh ta a Pahânohzy a hmâh aw. Ei ryhpazy zyh khoh leipa ei ta, ama hro ta ei bieraopazy â haopa vâta, ama paraona vâta hriena cha amâ tyh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chatahrasala ama chariahpazy râh liata ama y no chhao ta, âmo pahleipadia awpa nata ama hnohta ei biehrai parao awpa ta, âmo cha thy leipa aw ei na ta, a hao hra aw veih ei na, kei he Abeipa ama Khazohpa châ tlôh na ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama Khazohpa châ awpa ta, phopizy mohmô ta Izi râh tawhta ei chhi papuapa ama pathlatuhpazy hnohta ei biehrai kha, âmo vâna heta ei thei thlâh ha aw. Kei he Abeipa ei châ,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Chazy cha Abeipa ta Mawsi hmâpa ta Ano nata Izarei sawzy likah ta Sinai tlâh liata a taopa bieraopazy, pachianazy nata ryhpazy a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abeipa ta Mawsi chho ta, a hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Izarei sawzy chho la, ama hnohta hetana heta reih teh: Chyhsa ta Abeipa lâta chyhsapa hlâ awpa ta bie a siapa ta a taih sala, chyhsapa vyuhpa ta â phuhpa ta sôh pie awpa a châ khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chapaw a châ khiahta cha, kô kihpa tawhta kô sycharupa taih cha, supathaihpa tâkâ reizie ta a mâ tâkâ sekel sypangawh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chanô a châ khiahta cha, sekel sythôh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kô pangawhpa tawhta kô kihpa taih a châ khiahta cha, chapaw mâ sekel tlaw kih, chanô mâ sekel tlaw hrawh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thla khapa tawhta kô pangawhpa taih a châ khiahta cha, chapaw mâ tâkâ sekel tlaw pangawh, chanô mâ tâkâ sekel tlaw thôh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kô sycharu tawhta chô lâ a châ khiahta cha, chapaw mâ sekel tlaw hrawh hlei pangawh, chanô mâ sekel tlaw hrawh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dyhchhiepa châ sala a mâ na tupa zie a pie thei lei awpa a châ khiahta cha, theihthaipa lâ a chhi awpa châ ta, theihthaipa ta a mâ tu aw ta, bie a taihtuhpa tao theinazie hawhta theihthaipa ta a mâ a tu aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Abeipa lâ hlâ awpa ta bie â taihpa cha, sahroh a châ khiahta cha, Abeipa lâta a hlâpa zydua cha a pathaih haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A panano awpa châ khao vei. A chhiepa vyuhpa ta a phapa ta tlyma, a phapa vyuhpa ta a chhiepa ta tlyma a ri awpa châ hra vei. Sahroh lilaw ta a ri khiahta cha, a pô no ta, a ripa chhao, a rina chhao pathaihpa ama vaw châ ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sahroh pathaih leipa Abeipa lâta hlâ lei awpa chi a châ khiahta cha, sahroh cha theihthaipa hmiakô liata a soh awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theihthaipa ta a phana nata a pha leinazie hawhta, â phuhpa ta a mâ tu aw ta, a mâ cha theihthaipa ta a tunazie hawhta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chatlai heih awpa khiahta deikua cha, a mâ tupa zie su pangawh su kha a baichha awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta hmohlâ pathaihpa châta Abeipa lâta a o a hlâ khiahta cha, a phana nata a pha leinazie hawhta, theihthaipa ta a mâ tu aw ta, theihthaipa ta a mâ a tupa hawhta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hlâtuhpa ta a o cha a chatlai khoh khiahta cha, a mâ tupa zie su pangawh su kha baichha aw ta, chatanachata ano eih a châ heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta a lyu thokha Abeipa châta a hlâ khiahta cha, chi a tla thei awpa zie lymâ hawhta, a mâ tu awpa a châ. Bâli sâh bai kha tu theina lyu cha tâkâ sekel sypangawh a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lyu cha zubili kô ta hlâpa a châ khiahta cha, a mâ tupa hawhta a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zubili khai tawhta a hlâ khiahta deikua cha, zubili tlô heih nawpa kô a ypa zie hawhta theihthaipa ta a mâ tu aw ta, a pie awpa zie pachyh viapa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hlâtuhpa ta a chatlai khoh khiahta cha, a mâ tupa zie su pangawh su kha baichha aw ta, ano eih a châ heih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lyu cha a chatlai khoh vei tlyma, mohropa hnohta a zuah hapa tlyma a châ khiahta cha, chatlai heih theipa châ khao aw vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lyu cha Zubili kô liata papuapa a châ tita, hlâ hapa lyu hawhta Abeipa châta pathaihpa châ aw ta, theihthaipa eih a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chyhsa ta ano râh a châ leipa, a chaleipa lyu Abeipa lâta a hlâ khiahta cha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />theihthaipa ta zubili kô taihta a mâ awpa zie tu aw ta, a tupa hawhta, cha noh lia tlai ta Abeipa lâta hmo pathaihpa châta a hlâ awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zubili kô liata, lyu cha a chaleina chyhsa, a râh hneituhpa hnohta a pakua aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mâ tupa zydua cha supathaihpa tâkâ reizie ta châ khai aw ta, sekel tlaw kha cha kerâ miakih a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Sahroh a pataw tuapa deikua cha, Abeipa eih a châ chhielie hapa vâta, chyhsa ta a hlâ awpa châ vei. Viahchao tôhpa tlyma, mietaku tlyma, a pataw tuapa maih cha Abeipa eih a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sahroh pathaih leipa a châ khiahta cha, a mâ tupa zie ta a chatlai awpa châ ta, a mâ su pangawh su kha a baichha awpa a cha. Chatlaipa a châ vei khiahta cha, a mâ tupa zie ta zuah awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Chyhsa ta a hmohneipa Abeipa lâta a hlâ hapa, chyhsapa tlyma, sahroh tlyma, râh tlyma cha zuah awpa châ leipa ta, chatlai awpa châ hra vei. Hlâ hapa hmo zydua cha, Abeipa châta pathaih ngaitapa a châ khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pahleipadia awpa ta hlâ hapa chyhsa cha chatlai awpa châ vei. Thie thlyu awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Râh tawhta a puapa su hrawh su kha zydua, alei tawhta sâh nata tho theilâpa zydua Abeipa eih châ khai ta, Abeipa châta pathaihpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chyhsa ta a su hrawh su kha hry liata a kheihawhpa rai a chatlai khiahta cha, a mâ su pangawh su kha a baichha awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Viahchao hri nata mietaku zaw hry liata su hrawh su kha, chôchahrei ry liata â ngiapa, a pô hrawhna lymâ cha Abeipa châta pathaihpa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A pha nata pha lei a pasia awpa châ leipa ta, a ri awpa châ hra vei. A ri raruah khiahta cha, a pô no ta, a ripa chhao, a rina chhao, pathaihpa châ aw ei ta, chatlai theipa châ aw vei,” tah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chazy cha Sinai Tlâh liata Izarei sawzy châta Abeipa ta Mawsi a piepa biepiepazy a châ.
  </para>
</usx>
